Kinderen 9-12 j.","Familie","LGTBQIA"]}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["kids"]},{"id":5700002725,"date_start":"2025-01-31","date_end":"2025-02-09","date_next":"2025-02-02","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2025-02-02T01:01:04+01:00","published_at":"2024-10-17T16:10:27+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":309990,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"festival","ranking":0.7368062997280773,"languages":{"spoken":["nl","en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":118,"translations":{"de":"Festival","pt":null,"en":"Festival","it":"Festival","cn":null,"fr":"Festival","sp":"Festival","nl":"Festival"}},"others":{"list":[119],"translations":{"de":["Kino"],"pt":[null],"en":["Cinema  "],"it":["Cinema"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Cin\u00e9ma"],"sp":["Cine"],"nl":["Cinema"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Festivals Courts + Queer Mais Trash 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/courtsmaistrash.net\/","email":"info@courtsmaistrash.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002725"},"pt":{"name":"Festivals Courts + Queer Mais Trash 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/courtsmaistrash.net\/","email":"info@courtsmaistrash.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002725"},"en":{"name":"Festivals Courts + Queer Mais Trash 2025","shortdescr":"For its 20th edition, COURTS MAIS TRASH festival is once again joining forces with QUEER MAIS TRASH to kick off the film season in Brussels. From January 31 to February 9, 2025, this crucial event for independent, underground, political, and offbeat cinema will for the first time take place at Espace Magh, a couple of steps away from the iconic Manneken-Pis.","longdescr":"For its 20th edition, COURTS MAIS TRASH festival is once again joining forces with QUEER MAIS TRASH to kick off the film season in Brussels. From January 31 to February 9, 2025, this crucial event for independent, underground, political, and offbeat cinema will for the first time take place at Espace Magh, a couple of steps away from the iconic Manneken-Pis.\n\nTo mark this symbolic anniversary, the College of Mayor and City Councillors have approved the creation of a unique Manneken Mais Trash costume for the Manneken-Pis statue. A reception will celebrate this momentous occasion a few hours before the official launch of the festival. With over 7,500 festival-goers expected, screenings, school sessions, festive evenings, a cinema-concert and professional events, COURTS MAIS TRASH and QUEER MAIS TRASH are once again set to be major highlights of Brussels\u2019 artistic scene. More than 150 films will be screened, and over 50 filmmakers will share their work with the audience.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/courtsmaistrash.net\/","email":"info@courtsmaistrash.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002725"},"it":{"name":"Festivals Courts + Queer Mais Trash 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/courtsmaistrash.net\/","email":"info@courtsmaistrash.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002725"},"cn":{"name":"Festivals Courts + Queer Mais Trash 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/courtsmaistrash.net\/","email":"info@courtsmaistrash.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002725"},"fr":{"name":"Festivals Courts + Queer Mais Trash 2025","shortdescr":"Depuis 2005, Courts Mais Trash c\u00e9l\u00e8bre les courts m\u00e9trages underground. Pour marquer notre 20\u00e8me anniversaire, nous voyons les choses en grand avec une \u00e9dition XXL ! Pour vous accueillir en plus grand nombre, nous d\u00e9m\u00e9nageons \u00e0 l\u2019Espace Magh, en plein c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, \u00e0 deux pas de Manneken Pis. Une nouvelle salle de 350 places et un grand foyer vous attendent pour 9 jours de festivit\u00e9s !","longdescr":"Cr\u00e9\u00e9 en 2005, Courts Mais Trash c\u00e9l\u00e8bre les courts m\u00e9trages underground, d\u00e9cal\u00e9s et ind\u00e9pendants. \n\nPour son 20\u00e8me anniversaire, le festival voit les choses en grand avec une \u00e9dition XXL et s\u2019associe pour la premi\u00e8re fois \u00e0 l\u2019Espace Magh. Pr\u00e9parez-vous \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir le meilleur du cin\u00e9ma alternatif, politique, dr\u00f4le, fauch\u00e9 et trash !\n\nLes festivit\u00e9s d\u00e9marrent avec Queer Mais Trash du vendredi 31.01 au dimanche 2.02: trois jours pour explorer les th\u00e9matiques LGBTQIA+ et les s\u00e9ances f\u00e9ministes \u00ab Female Trouble \u00bb. Au programme : des films inclusifs et engag\u00e9s, et des \u00e9v\u00e9nements d\u00e9jant\u00e9s comme le Bingo Mais Trash anim\u00e9 par Edna Sorgelsen.\n\nEnsuite, Courts Mais Trash encha\u00eene du mardi 4.02 au dimanche 9.02. Cette \u00e9dition sp\u00e9ciale vous r\u00e9serve des Best of, des nouveaut\u00e9s comme des Longs Mais Trash, une grande exposition, des r\u00e9trospectives, des \u00e9v\u00e9nements pros, des s\u00e9ances scolaires et des After Trash Parties !\n\nPour pouvoir tou.te.s vous accueillir, le festival d\u00e9m\u00e9nage \u00e0 l\u2019Espace Magh et vous accueillera dans une ambiance conviviale et alternative !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/courtsmaistrash.net\/","email":"info@courtsmaistrash.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002725"},"sp":{"name":"Festivals Courts + Queer Mais Trash 2025","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/courtsmaistrash.net\/","email":"info@courtsmaistrash.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002725"},"nl":{"name":"Festivals Courts + Queer Mais Trash 2025","shortdescr":"For its 20th edition, COURTS MAIS TRASH festival is once again joining forces with QUEER MAIS TRASH to kick off the film season in Brussels. From January 31 to February 9, 2025, this crucial event for independent, underground, political, and offbeat cinema will for the first time take place at Espace Magh, a couple of steps away from the iconic Manneken-Pis.","longdescr":"For its 20th edition, COURTS MAIS TRASH festival is once again joining forces with QUEER MAIS TRASH to kick off the film season in Brussels. From January 31 to February 9, 2025, this crucial event for independent, underground, political, and offbeat cinema will for the first time take place at Espace Magh, a couple of steps away from the iconic Manneken-Pis.\n\nTo mark this symbolic anniversary, the College of Mayor and City Councillors have approved the creation of a unique Manneken Mais Trash costume for the Manneken-Pis statue. A reception will celebrate this momentous occasion a few hours before the official launch of the festival. With over 7,500 festival-goers expected, screenings, school sessions, festive evenings, a cinema-concert and professional events, COURTS MAIS TRASH and QUEER MAIS TRASH are once again 