numbers","email":"nora@254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005093"},"it":{"name":"Le Motel - Odd Numbers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/254forest.be\/odd-numbers","email":"nora@254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005093"},"cn":{"name":"Le Motel - Odd Numbers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/254forest.be\/odd-numbers","email":"nora@254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005093"},"fr":{"name":"Le Motel - Odd Numbers","shortdescr":"Dans le cadre du Photo Brussels Festival, Le Motel pr\u00e9sente Odd numbers \u00e0 254Forest - une exposition qui explore les liens entre souvenirs et futurs possibles, tiss\u00e9s \u00e0 travers la photographie, le son, la vid\u00e9o et le texte, en collaboration avec le graphiste Antoine Jaunard et le po\u00e8te Vietnamien Phapxa Chan.","longdescr":"Dans le cadre du Photo Brussels Festival, Le Motel pr\u00e9sente Odd Numbers, une exposition \u00e0 254Forest qui explore les liens entre souvenirs et futurs possibles, tiss\u00e9s \u00e0 travers un m\u00e9lange de photographies, vid\u00e9os et textes cr\u00e9\u00e9s en collaboration avec le designer et programmeur Antoine Jaunard et le po\u00e8te vietnamien Phapxa chan.\n\nRejoignez-nous : https:\/\/fb.me\/e\/55I8197LM\nL\u2019exposition prend forme autour d\u2019un voyage de Bruxelles \u00e0 Hano\u00ef, jusqu\u2019aux montagnes du nord du Vietnam, o\u00f9 la culture Hmong et la vie urbaine se m\u00ealent. \u00c0 travers des rencontres spontan\u00e9es, Le Motel a captur\u00e9 des moments uniques, que ce soit des rituels traditionnels ou des sc\u00e8nes de la vie quotidienne, pour cr\u00e9er une \u0153uvre sonore et visuelle o\u00f9 s\u2019entrelacent diff\u00e9rents univers.\n\nOdd Numbers est une invitation \u00e0 vivre une exp\u00e9rience sensorielle o\u00f9 pass\u00e9, pr\u00e9sent et futur se croisent, d\u00e9fiant les fronti\u00e8res entre cultures, rituels et modernit\u00e9.","performers":"Musique : Le Motel, Yvonne Qu\u1ef3nh-Lan D\u01b0\u01a1ng, Bui Thi Oanh, Phapxa Chan, Chi chi, Ma Ma Chi, Are Ro, Long Dang, Ho\u00e0ng Tu\u1ea5n, Truong Phu, Lander Gyselinck, Gretar Ingi Gunnlaugsson, Dung Tran Quoc.\n\n\nArtistes : Le Motel, Antoine Jaunard, Phapxa Chan\nCuration : Evelyn Simons","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/254forest.be\/odd-numbers","email":"nora@254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005093"},"sp":{"name":"Le Motel - Odd Numbers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/254forest.be\/odd-numbers","email":"nora@254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005093"},"nl":{"name":"Le Motel - Odd Numbers","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/254forest.be\/odd-numbers","email":"nora@254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005093"}},"place":{"id":274310,"translations":{"de":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Chaussee de Forest","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chaussee de Forest","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Chaussee de Forest","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chaussee de Forest","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Chaussee de Forest","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chaussee de Forest","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"254Forest was born in 2017 with the aim of creating a new collective creative space. Located in the heart of Saint-Gilles, ten minutes from the Midi Station, \r\nthe old industrial building has been renovated to welcome and bring together artists and professionals in the field of Image, Sound and New Technologies.\r\n\r\nComposed of 4 distinct but complementary spaces, including a photo studio, a coworking and a recording studio, \r\n254Forest also welcomes artists and collectives to present their work within the Room, its exhibition space (in front space), which was inaugurated in Spring 2019. \r\n\r\nThe ROOM's lineup reflects the collective and its extensive networks: \r\n- multidisciplinary through its artistic content related to Image, Sound and New Technologies;\r\n- hybrid in its presentation formats: exhibitions, talks, screenings, installations, performances, mini-concerts, etc.;\r\n- open by inviting local and international artists.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Chaussee de Forest","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chaussee de Forest","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Chaussee de Forest","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chaussee de Forest","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Chaussee de Forest","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chaussee de Forest","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Le 254Forest est n\u00e9 en 2017 dans le but de cr\u00e9er un nouvel espace collectif de cr\u00e9ation. Situ\u00e9 au coeur de Saint-Gilles, \r\n\u00e0 dix minutes de la gare du Midi, l\u2019ancien b\u00e2timent industriel a \u00e9t\u00e9 r\u00e9nov\u00e9 \r\npour accueillir et rassembler artistes et professionnels de l\u2019Image, du Son et des Nouvelles Technologies.\r\n\r\nCompos\u00e9 de 4 espaces distincts mais compl\u00e9mentaires, notamment d\u2019un studio photo, un coworking et d\u2019un studio d\u2019enregistrement, \r\nle 254Forest accueille \u00e9galement artistes et collectifs \u00e0 pr\u00e9senter leur travail au sein de La Room, son espace de diffusion (en vitrine), inaugur\u00e9 au printemps 2019. \r\n\r\nLa programmation de la ROOM est \u00e0 l\u2019image du collectif et de ses r\u00e9seaux \u00e9tendus: \r\n- pluridisciplinaire par son contenu artistique en lien \u00e0 l\u2019Image, au Son et aux Nouvelles Technologies ;\r\n- hybride par ses formats de pr\u00e9sentation : expositions, talks, projections, installations, performances, mini-concerts, etc.;\r\n- ouverte en y invitant des artistes locaux et internationaux.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Chaussee de Forest","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chaussee de Forest","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Vorstse Steenweg","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Vorstse Steenweg","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"254Forest is geboren in 2017 met als doel een nieuwe collectieve creatieve ruimte te cre\u00ebren. Gelegen in het hart van Sint-Gillis, op tien minuten van het Zuidstation. \r\nHet oude industri\u00eble gebouw is gerenoveerd om kunstenaars en professionals op het gebied van Beeld, Geluid en Nieuwe Technologie\u00ebn te ontvangen en samen te brengen.\r\n\r\nHet gebouw bestaat uit 4 verschillende maar complementaire ruimtes, waaronder een fotostudio, een coworking en een opnamestudio, \r\n254Forest verwelkomt ook kunstenaars en collectieven om hun werk te presenteren in de Room, de tentoonstellingsruimte (aan de voorgevel), die in het voorjaar van 2019 werd ingehuldigd. \r\n\r\nDe opstelling van de ROOM weerspiegelt het collectief en zijn uitgebreide netwerk: \r\n- multidisciplinair door zijn artistieke inhoud die gerelateerd is aan Beeld, Geluid en Nieuwe Technologie\u00ebn;\r\n- hybride in de presentatievormen: tentoonstellingen, lezingen, screenings, installaties, performances, miniconcerten, etc.;\r\n- open door lokale en internationale kunstenaars uit te nodigen.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":34310,"location":{"lat":50.83113073,"lon":4.34306111},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-04-03T16:34:58+02:00","published_at":"2019-08-22T12:07:42+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":274310,"translations":{"de":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Chaussee de Forest","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chaussee de Forest","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"254Forest","address_street_name":"Chaussee de Forest","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"hello@254forest.be","website":"http:\/\/www.254forest.be","phone_contact":null,"p