be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005626"},"en":{"name":"Fuck art, let's dance! Un Little Boy nomm\u00e9 Ferlinghetti","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/04\/fuck-art-let-s-dance","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005626"},"it":{"name":"Fuck art, let's dance! Un Little Boy nomm\u00e9 Ferlinghetti","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/04\/fuck-art-let-s-dance","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005626"},"cn":{"name":"Fuck art, let's dance! Un Little Boy nomm\u00e9 Ferlinghetti","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/04\/fuck-art-let-s-dance","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005626"},"fr":{"name":"Fuck art, let's dance! Un Little Boy nomm\u00e9 Ferlinghetti","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Ce midi po\u00e9sie met \u00e0 l\u2019honneur Lawrence Ferlinghetti, grand po\u00e8te et \u00e9diteur de la Beat Generation, en pr\u00e9sence de la traductrice Marianne Costa, du po\u00e8te J\u00e9r\u00e9my Tholom\u00e9, et de l\u2019\u00e9diteur et th\u00e9ra-po\u00e8te David Giannoni, des \u00e9ditions maelstr\u00d6m reEvolution.\n\nEn 2019, \u00e0 l\u2019occasion de son centenaire, paraissait aux \u00c9tats-Unis Little Boy, le dernier roman de Ferlinghetti. Ce texte, n\u00e9 d\u2019une collaboration \u00e9troite avec son assistant Mauro Aprile Zanetti, se voit enrichi d\u2019une postface d\u00e9voilant les dessous de sa cr\u00e9ation. Apr\u00e8s plusieurs ann\u00e9es de travail, la version fran\u00e7aise est enfin disponible gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 la traduction soign\u00e9e de Marianne Costa et \u00e0 la maison maelstr\u00d6m reEvolution.\n\nNi m\u00e9moires, ni autobiographie, Little Boy retrace les souvenirs imaginaires de Ferlinghetti, depuis sa prime enfance et ses origines europ\u00e9ennes jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ses r\u00e9flexions sur l\u2019avenir de la d\u00e9mocratie am\u00e9ricaine, au cr\u00e9puscule de sa vie. Il \u00e9voque librement ses conqu\u00eates amoureuses, ses \u00e9checs, ses rencontres avec Jack Kerouac et Allen Ginsberg, le Mississippi, le Mont Analogue, la Seconde Guerre mondiale, et l\u2019\u00e9cologie. Sa prose, fluide et ininterrompue, incarne l\u2019essence m\u00eame de l\u2019esprit beat.\n\nPubli\u00e9 originellement le 24 mars 2019, jour de ses 100 ans, Little Boy rejoint d\u00e9sormais les \u0153uvres traduites de Ferlinghetti chez maelstr\u00d6m reEvolution, aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de Blind Poet, D\u00e9mocratie totalitaire, A Coney Island of the Mind, et Po\u00e9sie Art de l\u2019Insurrection.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/04\/fuck-art-let-s-dance","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005626"},"sp":{"name":"Fuck art, let's dance! Un Little Boy nomm\u00e9 Ferlinghetti","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/04\/fuck-art-let-s-dance","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005626"},"nl":{"name":"Fuck art, let's dance! Un Little Boy nomm\u00e9 Ferlinghetti","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/04\/fuck-art-let-s-dance","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005626"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmasters Museum, Modern Museum, Meunier Museum, Wiertz Museum, Magritte Museum and the Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Reale delle Belle Arti del Belgio","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"I Musei Reali delle Belle Arti del Belgio sono sei musei 