":{"name":"Marolles For Ever by Hakim Louk'man & Othmane Moumen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lestanneurs.be\/spectacle\/marolles-for-ever\/","email":"info@lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 43","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010824"},"pt":{"name":"Marolles For Ever by Hakim Louk'man & Othmane Moumen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lestanneurs.be\/spectacle\/marolles-for-ever\/","email":"info@lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 43","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010824"},"en":{"name":"Marolles For Ever by Hakim Louk'man & Othmane Moumen","shortdescr":"Nestled in the heart of Brussels, beneath the monumental Palace of Justice, the Marolles neighbourhood is an emblematic area of our capital. Its cobbled streets, flea markets and traditional folklore are all familiar to us... But what really hides behind this very special part of town?","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lestanneurs.be\/spectacle\/marolles-for-ever\/","email":"info@lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 43","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010824"},"it":{"name":"Marolles For Ever by Hakim Louk'man & Othmane Moumen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lestanneurs.be\/spectacle\/marolles-for-ever\/","email":"info@lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 43","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010824"},"cn":{"name":"Marolles For Ever by Hakim Louk'man & Othmane Moumen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lestanneurs.be\/spectacle\/marolles-for-ever\/","email":"info@lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 43","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010824"},"fr":{"name":"Marolles For Ever de Hakim Louk'man & Othmane Moumen","shortdescr":"Nich\u00e9es au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, \u00e0 l\u2019ombre du monumental palais de justice, les Marolles sont un quartier embl\u00e9matique de notre capitale. Tout le monde a \u00e0 l\u2019esprit ses pav\u00e9s, ses brocanteurs, son folklore\u2026 Mais qu\u2019est-ce qui se cache derri\u00e8re ce quartier singulier ?","longdescr":"Un quartier au c\u0153ur de la ville et, depuis toujours, en marge. Peut-\u00eatre est-ce l\u00e0 l\u2019origine de l\u2019esprit frondeur du Marollien\u00b7ne, r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement en conflit avec l\u2019autorit\u00e9. Les tentatives, de museler les Marollien\u00b7nes, de mater cet esprit de contestation, les expulsions, expropriations et volont\u00e9s de gentrification se sont sold\u00e9es par des \u00e9checs. Envers et contre tout, la Marolle r\u00e9siste. Les Marolles, c\u2019est aussi une terre d\u2019accueil pour des immigr\u00e9\u00b7es venu\u00b7es du monde entier. Mais en fait, faut-il dire la Marolle ? Ou les Marolles ? Et au fond, c\u2019est quoi un\u00b7e Marollien\u00b7ne ? Est-ce que c\u2019est la Marolle qui fait le\/la Marollien\u00b7ne ? Ou les Marollien\u00b7nes qui font la Marolle ?\n\n\u00c0 la mani\u00e8re des conteurs de la place Djema El Fna \u2013 c\u2019est comme la place du Jeu de balle, mais en plus exotique \u2013, les deux griots, Hakim Louk\u2019man et Othmane Moumen, tentent de d\u00e9voiler un pan de l\u2019histoire des Marolles et vous invitent \u00e0 un voyage haut en couleurs, rencontre improbable entre les \"Mille et Une Nuits\" et Pitje Schramouille.","performers":"\u00c9criture, jeu et conception Hakim Louk\u2019man et Othmane Moumen\nRegards bienveillants le Kholektif Zouf (Myriem Akheddiou, Jasmina Douieb et Monia Douieb)\nAccompagnement en production et diffusion Ad Lib \u2013 Support d\u2019artistes\n\nUn spectacle de Hakim Louk\u2019man & Othmane Moumen | Une production d\u00e9l\u00e9gu\u00e9e (XS) du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Les Tanneurs | Othmane Moumen est artiste associ\u00e9 au Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Les Tanneurs.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lestanneurs.be\/spectacle\/marolles-for-ever\/","email":"info@lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 43","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010824"},"sp":{"name":"Marolles For Ever by Hakim Louk'man & Othmane Moumen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lestanneurs.be\/spectacle\/marolles-for-ever\/","email":"info@lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 43","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010824"},"nl":{"name":"Marolles For Ever vzn Hakim Louk'man & Othmane Moumen","shortdescr":"In hartje Brussel, in de schaduw van het reusachtige Justitiepaleis, ligt de legendarische Marollenwijk van onze hoofdstad. Iedereen kent de beroemde klinkerstraten, de brocantes, de folklore\u2026 Maar wat geeft deze bijzondere wijk niet zomaar prijs?","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lestanneurs.be\/spectacle\/marolles-for-ever\/","email":"info@lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 37 43","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010824"}},"place":{"id":227243,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Les Tanneurs ","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"75","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lestanneurs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 17 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 75","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Les Tanneurs ","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"75","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lestanneurs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 17 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 75","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Les Tanneurs","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"75","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lestanneurs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 17 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 75","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Since its creation in 1999, the Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Les Tanneurs - Maison d'artistes & Fabrique de th\u00e9\u00e2tre - has been dedicated to contemporary creation in theatre and dance. Creation and innovation, research, assistance and support for artists, citizenship, international openness, and the social life of the Marolles district are the Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Les Tanneurs' key concerns.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Les Tanneurs ","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"75","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lestanneurs.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lestanneurs.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 17 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 17 84","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","addr