ons","email":"reservation@poche.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 649 17 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011031"},"it":{"name":"Poumons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/poche.be\/show\/2024-poumons","email":"reservation@poche.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 649 17 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011031"},"cn":{"name":"Poumons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/poche.be\/show\/2024-poumons","email":"reservation@poche.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 649 17 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011031"},"fr":{"name":"Poumons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"\u00ab Et si cet enfant, ce petit Edwin ou cette petite Hannah imaginaire. Si elle ou il \u00e9tait la personne capable de tout r\u00e9soudre, de tout sauver : l\u2019humanit\u00e9, le monde, les ours polaires, le Bangladesh, tout\u2026 ? \u00bb\n\nUn jeune couple dans la queue d\u2019Ikea. Un couple moderne. Il a envie d\u2019avoir un b\u00e9b\u00e9. Elle aussi. Il faudra qu\u2019elle arr\u00eate de fumer. Mais ils ont besoin de r\u00e9fl\u00e9chir. Beaucoup. Trop ? Parce qu\u2019enfin quoi, la surpopulation, le r\u00e9chauffement plan\u00e9taire, les probl\u00e8mes environnementaux\u2026\n\nEt puis, d\u2019abord, il p\u00e8se combien l\u2019impact carbone d\u2019un enfant? Ah oui quand m\u00eame : environ 7 ans d\u2019allers retours quotidiens entre Bruxelles et New York\u2026 \"C'est le poids de la Tour Eiffel. Je donnerais naissance \u00e0 la Tour Eiffel\".\n\nPoumons est une com\u00e9die dramatique qui taquine d\u00e9licieusement nos choix vertueux, nos peurs et nos n\u00e9vroses, nos d\u00e9sirs pas toujours communs...\n\nPoumons, s\u2019il inscrit son action dans la course effr\u00e9n\u00e9e du temps qui passe, est \u00e9galement le portrait d\u2019un amour imparfait dans un monde imparfait. Dans lequel nous devrions nous reconna\u00eetre, tant il est le miroir de nos couples modernes. Au Poche, nous prenons le pari que nous arriverons \u00e0 nous faire (sou)rire de nous-m\u00eames\u2026","performers":"De Duncan Macmillan | Traduction S\u00e9verine Magois | Mise en sc\u00e8ne Anne-Pascale Clairembourg | Avec Elisa Firouzfar et F\u00e9lix Vannoorenberghe | Dramaturgie et assistanat \u00e0 la mise en sc\u00e8ne Elise Di Pierro | Sc\u00e9nographie No\u00e9mie Vanheste | Cr\u00e9ation Lumi\u00e8res Gr\u00e9goire Tempels","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/poche.be\/show\/2024-poumons","email":"reservation@poche.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 649 17 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011031"},"sp":{"name":"Poumons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/poche.be\/show\/2024-poumons","email":"reservation@poche.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 649 17 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011031"},"nl":{"name":"Poumons","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/poche.be\/show\/2024-poumons","email":"reservation@poche.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 649 17 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011031"}},"place":{"id":943,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Poche","address_street_name":"Chemin du Gymnase","address_street_number":"1 A","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@poche.be","website":"http:\/\/www.poche.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 649 17 27","phone_booking":"+32 2 649 17 27","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Chemin du Gymnase, 1 A","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url"