 il faut dire qu\u2019Elie lui pla\u00eet beaucoup.","longdescr":"Elie vient d\u2019arriver dans l\u2019\u00e9cole. Ses parents viennent d\u2019apprendre qu\u2019elle est lesbienne et maintenant\u2026\n\nTroubl\u00e9es nait de l\u2019\u00e9criture de trois adolescentes, elles abordent l\u2019homosexualit\u00e9 f\u00e9minine et la lesbophobie (homophobie + sexisme).\n\n\u00c0 la fin du spectacle, le public est invit\u00e9 \u00e0 \u00e9changer avec Mia, Clem et Elie.\n\nEn lien avec les questions abord\u00e9es par le programme de l'Evras ","performers":"Auteures : Emma Schoeps, Lisa Utermont, Julia Lemort\nMise en sc\u00e8ne : Mathilde Collard\nInterpr\u00e9tation : Blanche Delhausse, Elise Henrion, Justine Bialy\nLumi\u00e8res : Loris Legnaro\nSc\u00e9nographie : Mathilde Collard\nR\u00e9gie : Loris Legnaro, Mathilde Collard\nProducteur : S\u00e9isme asbl ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001595"},"sp":{"name":"Troubl\u00e9es","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001595"},"nl":{"name":"Troubl\u00e9es","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001595"}},"place":{"id":4,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Jacques Franck","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"94","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejacquesfr