9-enchantement de la vie.","longdescr":"Dans ce seul en sc\u00e8ne, Etienne Van der Belen (re)tisse les fils d'une histoire v\u00e9cue avec la mort de son p\u00e8re au d\u00e9but du confinement. L'acteur convie le public dans l\u2019espace sacr\u00e9 du th\u00e9\u00e2tre o\u00f9 il partage avec les spectateur.ices un rite singulier et festif. C\u00e9l\u00e9bration(s) propose une exp\u00e9rience de r\u00e9paration collective. C\u2019est un appel \u00e0 la joie et au r\u00e9-enchantement de la vie.\n","performers":"Conception et jeu Etienne Van der Belen | Co-\u00e9criture et mise en sc\u00e8ne Barbara Sylvain | Sc\u00e9nographie et costumes Val\u00e8re Le Dourner | Cr\u00e9ation lumi\u00e8res J\u00e9r\u00f4me Dejean","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lesrichesclaires.be\/saison\/celebrations\/","email":"diffusion@lesrichesclaires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 25 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 25 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001490"},"sp":{"name":"C\u00e9l\u00e9bration(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lesrichesclaires.be\/saison\/celebrations\/","email":"diffusion@lesrichesclaires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 25 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 25 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001490"},"nl":{"name":"C\u00e9l\u00e9bration(s)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lesrichesclaires.be\/saison\/celebrations\/","email":"diffusion@lesrichesclaires.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 548 25 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 548 25 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700001490"}},"place":{"id":1085,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Les Riches-Claires","address_street_name":"Rue des Riches Claires","address_street_number":"24","address_street_box":null,"email":"accueil@lesrichesclaires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lesri