detail.5700004458"},"fr":{"name":"\u00c9bats de Couples","shortdescr":"Ah ! Le couple, quel r\u00eave de bonheur ! Vivre ensemble c\u00f4te \u00e0 c\u00f4te en regardant dans la m\u00eame direction. Pas un nuage \u00e0 l\u2019horizon\u2026 Et nous, les femmes, que serions-nous, sans vous, les hommes ? Si honn\u00eates, si respectueux !\u2026 Et pourtant! \u2026 Si seulement !\u2026","longdescr":" \u00ab...\u00a0Deux heures de fou rire continu\u00a0! Voir les quatre com\u00e9diens qui s\u2019amusent bien... Ils sont tout simplement formidables dans l\u2019interpr\u00e9tation de leurs personnages...\u00a0\u00bb (Les Feux de la Rampe) Ah ! le couple, quel r\u00eave de bonheur ! Vivre ensemble c\u00f4te \u00e0 c\u00f4te en regardant dans la m\u00eame direction. Pas un nuage \u00e0 l'horizon... Et pourtant\u00a0!... Si seulement\u00a0!... Les auteurs, Feydeau et Courteline, nous pr\u00e9sentent un \u00e9trange tableau des relations conjugales et extraconjugales. Venez voir ces couples qui se d\u00e9chirent dans un spectacle o\u00f9 le rire est omnipr\u00e9sent. \u00ab\u00a0...Ces com\u00e9diens tiennent bien leur r\u00f4le de mousquetaires de la querelle perp\u00e9tuelle \u00e9lev\u00e9e au rang de mode de vie. Devant la Com\u00e9die Humaine, l\u2019assistance tour \u00e0 tour, se tait, m\u00e9dus\u00e9e ou se laisse gagner par le rire...\u00a0\u00bb.","performers":"Delphine Charlier (Mme Boulingrin, Yvonne, mise en sc\u00e8ne); Anne Chantraine (Annette, F\u00e9licie); Marc De Roy (Des Rillettes, Lucien); Boris Olivier (M. Boulingrin, Joseph); Courteline (texte); Feydeau (texte)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004458"},"sp":{"name":"\u00c9bats de Couples","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004458"},"nl":{"name":"\u00c9bats de Couples","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be\/","email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004458"}},"place":{"id":220283,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Dieses malerische Caf\u00e9-Theater, das 1994 in der N\u00e4he des alten \"Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles\" er\u00f6ffnet wurde, \u00fcberrascht durch seine \u00fcberaus kleinen R\u00e4umlichkeiten. Doch daf\u00fcr ist das Programm ist umso \"gr\u00f6\u00dfer\". Reservierung empfohlen!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 54","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The desire to present theater amongst people; as if a performance is nothing but a conversation, in a place somewhere in between the large halls and the streets, half living room, half pub, in a warm ambiance where one can sip a glass while watching a performance. That's cafe-theater \"Le Jardin de ma Soeur\", at the edge of the ancient \"Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles\", alongside one of the quays of the old port of Brussels where the spirit of the dock workers lingers and where one can still feel the presence of the beguines with their long black robes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Jardin de ma S\u0153ur est situ\u00e9 au coin d'une rue du pittoresque March\u00e9 aux poissons, \u00e0 proximit\u00e9 de l\u2019ancien Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles. On peut difficilement imaginer un nom plus familier. Pourtant, cet endroit n'a pas vol\u00e9 son nom. Vous obtenez exactement ce que vous attendez : une soir\u00e9e sans pr\u00e9tention, pleine de divertissements et de moments partag\u00e9s. Vous vous y sentez comme dans votre salon. Vous oubliez imm\u00e9diatement tous vos soucis et riez, chantez et profitez du spectacle avec les autres participants. Sp\u00e9cialement pour les amateurs de chanson fran\u00e7aise et de th\u00e9\u00e2tre.  \u202f \r\nPensez \u00e0 r\u00e9server votre place !\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Grand Hospice, 54","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Grootgodshuisstraat","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grootgodshuisstraat, 54","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Op een straathoek aan de pittoreske Vismarkt ligt Le Jardin de ma Soeur. Een familialere naam kan je haast niet bedenken. Toch heeft deze plek haar naam niet gestolen. Je krijgt exact wat je er zou verwachten: een pretentieloze avond vol vertier en gedeelde momenten. Hier waan je je in een gezellige en veilige woonkamer. Je vergeet er meteen al je zorgen en lacht, zingt en geniet met de andere aanwezigen. Vooral voor liefhebbers van het Franse chanson en verhaaltheater.    \u202f\u202f\u202f ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"terassequai","backoffice_id":596,"location":{"lat":50.8535193,"lon":4.347348},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-11-06T09:12:27+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:39+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":220283,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"Rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":"54","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 