se,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":317138,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"other","ranking":0.43679023236814946,"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[35,24],"translations":{"de":["Comics","Kunstgalerien"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Comicstrip","Art Galleries"],"it":["Fumetti","Gallerie d'arte"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Bande dessin\u00e9e","Galeries d'art"],"sp":["C\u00f3mics","Galer\u00edas de arte"],"nl":["Stripverhaal","Galeries"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Exhibition  \"Petit Pays\"\/Sylvain Savoia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005976"},"pt":{"name":"Exhibition  \"Petit Pays\"\/Sylvain Savoia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005976"},"en":{"name":"\"Petit Pays\"\/Sylvain Savoia","shortdescr":"The graphic novelisation of Petit pays (Fnac Novel Prize and Prix Goncourt des lyc\u00e9ens in 2016), the famous novel by Ga\u00ebl Faye (Prix Renaudot 2024 for Jaracanda) was a challenge! Marzena Sowa (script) and Sylvain Savoia (illustration) produced a brilliant masterwork that accurately captures the clash between paradise and hell permeating Faye's novel.\n","longdescr":"The graphic novelisation of Petit pays (Fnac Novel Prize and Prix Goncourt des lyc\u00e9ens in 2016), the famous novel by Ga\u00ebl Faye (Prix Renaudot 2024 for Jaracanda) was a challenge! Marzena Sowa (script) and Sylvain Savoia (illustration) produced a brilliant masterwork that accurately captures the clash between paradise and hell permeating Faye's novel.\nThe vibrant atmosphere of Bujumbura is the setting for Gaby's childhood, inspired by that of the novelist. This is followed by the geopolitical deterioration in the region, civil war and the Tutsi genocide in Rwanda. An unleashing of senseless violence.\nElegant and refined, Sylvain Savoia's line constantly serves the story.\nWith his mastery of framing, he creates captivating full-page images that alternate with intense comics pages, to fully immerse the reader in scenes of action and emotion that grab us by the throat.\nIn short, a really successful adaptation, a moving graphic novel that Galerie Champaka is pleased to spotlight with a rich display of covers, pages and illustrations!\n","performers":"Ga\u00ebl Faye, Sylvain Savoia, Marzena Sowa, Petit Pays, Rwanda, Burundi.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005976"},"it":{"name":"Exhibition  \"Petit Pays\"\/Sylvain Savoia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005976"},"cn":{"name":"Exhibition  \"Petit Pays\"\/Sylvain Savoia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005976"},"fr":{"name":"\"Petit Pays\"\/Sylvain Savoia","shortdescr":"L'adaptation en bande dessin\u00e9e de \u00ab Petit Pays \u00bb (Prix du roman Fnac et Prix Goncourt des lyc\u00e9ens en 2016), le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre roman de Ga\u00ebl Faye (Prix Renaudot 2024 pour \u00ab Jaracanda \u00bb) relevait du d\u00e9fi ! Marzena Sowa (sc\u00e9nario) et Sylvain Savoia (dessin) ont r\u00e9alis\u00e9 avec brio un travail d'orf\u00e8vre qui restitue avec justesse le choc entre le paradis et l'enfer impr\u00e9gnant le roman de Faye.","longdescr":"L'adaptation en bande dessin\u00e9e de Petit pays (Prix du roman Fnac et Prix Goncourt des lyc\u00e9ens en 2016), le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre roman de Ga\u00ebl Faye (Prix Renaudot 2024 pour Jaracanda) relevait du d\u00e9fi ! Marzena Sowa (sc\u00e9nario) et Sylvain Savoia (dessin) ont r\u00e9alis\u00e9 avec brio un travail d'orf\u00e8vre qui restitue avec justesse le choc entre le paradis et l'enfer impr\u00e9gnant le roman de Faye.\nAux ambiances color\u00e9es de Bujumbura o\u00f9 se d\u00e9roule l'enfance de Gaby inspir\u00e9e de celle du romancier, succ\u00e8dent une d\u00e9gradation g\u00e9opolitique dans la r\u00e9gion, la guerre civile et le g\u00e9nocide des Tutsi au Rwanda. Un d\u00e9cha\u00eenement de violence insens\u00e9e.\nEl\u00e9gant et \u00e9pur\u00e9, le trait de Sylvain Savoia sert en permanence le r\u00e9cit. \nAvec sa ma\u00eetrise du d\u00e9coupage, il cr\u00e9e d'envo\u00fbtantes images en pleines pages qui alternent avec des planches intenses plongeant pleinement le lecteur dans l\u2019action ou les sc\u00e8nes d\u2019\u00e9motions qui nous prennent \u00e0 la gorge.\nBref, une adaptation tr\u00e8s r\u00e9ussie, un roman graphique bouleversant que la Galerie Champaka a le plaisir de pr\u00e9senter avec un riche dispositif de couvertures, planches et illustrations !\n\n","performers":"Ga\u00ebl Faye, Sylvain Savoia, Marzena Sowa, Petit Pays, Rwanda, Burundi.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005976"},"sp":{"name":"Exhibition  \"Petit Pays\"\/Sylvain Savoia","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005976"},"nl":{"name":"\"Petit Pays\"\/Sylvain Savoia","shortdescr":"De adaptatie in stripvorm van Petit Pays (Fnac prijs van de roman en Prix Goncourt des lyc\u00e9ens in 2016), de beroemde roman van Ga\u00ebl Faye (Prix Renaudot 2024 voor Jaracanda) was een ware uitdaging! Marzena Sowa (scenario) en Sylvain Savoia (tekeningen) leverden schitterend werk dat haarfijn de schok tussen paradijs en hel weergeeft die de roman van Faye beheerst.","longdescr":"\nDe adaptatie in stripvorm van Petit Pays (Fnac prijs van de roman en Prix Goncourt des lyc\u00e9ens in 2016), de beroemde roman van Ga\u00ebl Faye (Prix Renaudot 2024 voor Jaracanda) was een ware uitdaging! Marzena Sowa (scenario) en Sylvain Savoia (tekeningen) leverden schitterend werk dat haarfijn de schok tussen paradijs en hel weergeeft die de roman van Faye beheerst.\nIn de kleurrijke omgeving van Bujumbura, waar de jeugd van Gaby zich afspeelt, ge\u00efnspireerd door die van de romanschrijver, volgen de geopolitieke teloorgang van de streek, de burgeroorlog en de volkerenmoord van de Tutsi in Rwanda mekaar op. Een uitbarsting van zinloos geweld.\nDe elegante en zuivere lijnen van Sylvain Savoia dienen altijd het verhaal. \nMet zijn meesterlijke bladschikking cre\u00ebert hij betoverende beelden op volle pagina afgewisseld met intense platen die de lezer meedogenloos meeslepen in de actie of emotionele sc\u00e8nes, die ons bij de keel grijpen.\nKortom een erg geslaagde adaptatie, een onthutsende graphic novel waarvan Galerij Champaka met genoegen een rijke selectie voorstelt van omslagen, platen en illustraties!\n","performers":"Ga\u00ebl Faye, Sylvain Savoia, Marzena Sowa, Petit Pays, Rwanda, Burundi.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005976"}},"place":{"id":248804,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Champaka","address_street_name":"Rue Ernest Allard","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 91 52","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ernest Allard, 27","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Champaka","address_street_name":"Rue Ernest Allard","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 91 52","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ernest Allard, 27","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Champaka","address_street_name":"Rue Ernest Allard","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 91 52","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Ernest Allard, 27","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Galerie Champaka introduces comic art to the Grand Sablon, a neighbourhood traditionally dedicated to the \u201cancient\u201d, \u201cmodern\u201d and \u201ccontemporary\u201d arts. In a mansion on two floors, the gallery shows that today\u2019s creators of comic art are true heirs of the great masters from the past, all of them ceaselessly perfecting a narrative technique which is making comics into a major contemporary artform","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Champaka","address_street_name":"Rue Ernest Allard","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 91 52","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ernest Allard, 27","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Champaka","address_street_name":"Rue Ernest Allard","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 91 52","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ernest Allard, 27","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Champaka","address_street_name":"Rue Ernest Allard","address_street_number":"27","address_street_box":null,"email":"sablon@galeriechampaka.com","website":"http:\/\/www.galeriechampaka.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 91 52","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Ernest Allard, 27","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"\r\nLa Galerie Champaka fait entrer la Bande Dessin\u00e9e au Grand Sablon, un quartier traditionnellement d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux arts \" anciens \", \" modernes \", \" contemporains \" et \" premiers \". Dans une maison de ma\u00eetre, sur deux niveaux, la galeri