uti, actor; Ad\u00e8le Legrand, flutist","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-07-luxe-calme-et-volupte\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005875"},"pt":{"name":"\u2018Luxe, Calme et Volupt\u00e9\u2019 - Poetic and musical dialogue with Eveline Legrand, narrator; Pietro Pizzuti, actor; Ad\u00e8le Legrand, flutist","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-07-luxe-calme-et-volupte\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005875"},"en":{"name":"\u2018Luxe, Calme et Volupt\u00e9\u2019 - Poetic and musical dialogue with Eveline Legrand, narrator; Pietro Pizzuti, actor; Ad\u00e8le Legrand, flutist","shortdescr":"LUXURY, CALMNESS AND VOLUPTUOUSNESS\n\nA poetic and musical dialogue combining texts and music on the theme of\nLuxury, Calm and Voluptuousness, based on Charles Baudelaire's Les Fleurs du Mal.\nA collection of texts full of colour, nuance and deep thought about the connections between love, desire, passion, the ideal and spleen.\n","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-07-luxe-calme-et-volupte\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005875"},"it":{"name":"\u2018Luxe, Calme et Volupt\u00e9\u2019 - Poetic and musical dialogue with Eveline Legrand, narrator; Pietro Pizzuti, actor; Ad\u00e8le Legrand, flutist","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-07-luxe-calme-et-volupte\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005875"},"cn":{"name":"\u2018Luxe, Calme et Volupt\u00e9\u2019 - Poetic and musical dialogue with Eveline Legrand, narrator; Pietro Pizzuti, actor; Ad\u00e8le Legrand, flutist","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-07-luxe-calme-et-volupte\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005875"},"fr":{"name":"\u00bb Luxe, Calme et Volupt\u00e9 \u00bb \u2013 Dialogue po\u00e9tique et musical avec Eveline Legrand, r\u00e9citante; Pietro Pizzuti, com\u00e9dien; Ad\u00e8le Legrand, fl\u00fbtiste","shortdescr":"LUXE, CALME et VOLUPTE \n\nUn dialogue po\u00e9tique et musical entrem\u00ealant textes et musiques sur le th\u00e8me de\nLuxe, Calme et Volupt\u00e9 \u00e0 partir des Fleurs du Mal de Charles Baudelaire.\nUn ensemble de textes haut en couleurs, en nuances et en pens\u00e9es profondes sur les\ncorrespondances entre amour, d\u00e9sir, passion, id\u00e9al et spleen.\n","longdescr":"PROGRAMME :\n\n \n\nLUXE :\n\nMusique  \u00ab Pi\u00e8ce pour fl\u00fbte seule \u00ab  \u2013  Jacques Ibert\n\n1\/L\u2019Invitation au voyage \u2013  Les fleurs du mal \u2013  Charles Baudelaire\n\n2\/  Toucher Terre   \u2013   Jacques-Andr\u00e9 Saintonge\n\n3\/ Orgie   \u2013   Geo Norge\n\n4\/ Les Bijoux  \u2013  Les fleurs du mal   \u2013   Charles Baudelaire\n\n5\/ Eloges  extrait V    \u2013   Saint- John Perse\n\n \n\nCALME :\n\nMusique \u00ab Syrinx \u00bb  \u2013   Claude Debussy\n\n1\/ Sur des peintures de Philippe Crocq et B\u00e9atrice Libert\n\n2\/ XV  \u2013  20 Po\u00e8mes d\u2019amour \u2013    Pablo Neruda\n\n3\/ C\u2019est un matin de haute lumi\u00e8re    \u2013     Agn\u00e8s Henrard\n\n4\/ Il faudra que tu viennes  \u2013  extrait Le feu  \u2013   Corinne Hoex\n\n  5\/ Sur le papier en silence   \u2013     Pierre Schroven\n\n6\/ Dans ma chambre int\u00e9rieure     \u2013     Martine Rouhart\n\n7\/ L\u00e9gende du silence   \u2013   Marie-Claire d\u2019Orbaix\n\n8\/ Sous la lune aux toits d\u2019ardoise   \u2013     Alain Bosquet de Thoran\n\n9\/ Que le soir m\u2019enivre   \u2013  Robert Lambeaux\n\nMusique \u00ab Labyrinthes \u00bb   \u2013  Michel Lysight\n\n \n\nVOLUPTE :\n\n1\/ Amour    \u2013     Le tombeau des rois      \u2013      Anne H\u00e9bert\n\n2\/ L\u2019Orante    \u2013    Colette Nys-Mazure\n\n3\/ La Vie ant\u00e9rieure  \u2013   Les fleurs du mal \u2013  Charles Baudelaire\n\n4\/ J\u2019aurais voulu    \u2013    Isabelle Bielecki\n\n5\/ Parfum exotique   \u2013    Les fleurs du mal   \u2013    Charles Baudelaire\n\n6\/ Un Serpent     \u2013    Anne-Marie Der\u00e8se\n\n 7\/ En vertu de l\u2019amour  \u2013  Derniers po\u00e8mes \u2013  Paul Eluard\n\n 8\/ Ave     \u2013    Catherine Pozzi\n\n9\/ Trinit\u00e9    \u2013    Michel Ducobu\n\nMusique Sonata \u00ab Appassionata \u00bb Op.140  \u2013  Sigfrid Karg-Elert\n\n10\/ Colloque sentimental   \u2013   Les f\u00eates galantes  \u2013  Paul Verlaine\n\n11 La Beaut\u00e9   \u2013   Les Fleurs du mal    \u2013    Charles Baudelaire\n\nMusique  \u00ab Pr\u00e9t\u00e9rition \u00ab   Cr\u00e9ation pour ce spectacle de Michel Lysight\n\n \n\n ","performers":" Eveline Legrand, r\u00e9citante; Pietro Pizzuti, com\u00e9dien; Ad\u00e8le Legrand, fl\u00fbtiste","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-07-luxe-calme-et-volupte\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005875"},"sp":{"name":"\u2018Luxe, Calme et Volupt\u00e9\u2019 - Poetic and musical dialogue with Eveline Legrand, narrator; Pietro Pizzuti, actor; Ad\u00e8le Legrand, flutist","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-07-luxe-calme-et-volupte\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005875"},"nl":{"name":"\u201cLuxe, Calme et Volupt\u00e9\u201d - Po\u00ebtische en muzikale dialoog met Eveline Legrand, vertelster; Pietro Pizzuti, acteur; Ad\u00e8le Legrand, fluitiste","shortdescr":"LUXE, RUST EN WELLUST \n\nEen po\u00ebtische en muzikale dialoog van tekst en muziek over het thema\nLuxe, rust en wellust, gebaseerd op de Fleurs du Mal van Charles Baudelaire.\nEen verzameling teksten vol kleur, nuance en diepzinnige gedachten over de overeenkomsten\ntussen liefde, verlangen, passie,  ideaal en spleen\n","longdescr":"LUXE :\n\nMuziek \u201cStuk voor fluit solo\u201d - Jacques Ibert\n\n1\/De uitnodiging tot reizen - De bloemen van het kwaad - Charles Baudelaire\n\n2\/ De aarde aanraken - Jacques-Andr\u00e9 Saintonge\n\n3\/ Orgie - Geo Norge\n\n4\/ De juwelen - De bloemen van het kwaad - Charles Baudelaire\n\n5\/ Lof uittreksel V - Saint John Perse\n\n \n\nRUST :\n\nMuziek \u201cSyrinx\u201d - Claude Debussy\n\n1\/ Over de schilderijen van Philippe Crocq en B\u00e9atrice Libert\n\n2\/ XV - 20 Liefdesgedichten - Pablo Neruda\n\n3\/ Het is een heldere ochtend - Agn\u00e8s Henrard\n\n4\/ Je zult moeten komen - uittreksel Het vuur - Corinne Hoex\n\n  5\/ Op papier in stilte - Pierre Schroven\n\n6\/ In mijn binnenkamer - Martine Rouhart\n\n7\/ Legende van de stilte - Marie-Claire d'Orbaix\n\n8\/Onder de  leistenen daken maan  - Alain Bosquet de Thoran\n\n9\/ Dat de avond mij bedwelmt - Robert Lambeaux\n\nMuziek \u201c De labyrinten \u201d - Michel Lysight\n\nVOLUPTE:\n\n1\/ Liefde \u2013 Het Graf der Koningen \u2013 Anne H\u00e9bert\n\n2\/ De Orante \u2013 Colette Nys-Mazure\n\n3\/ Het vorige leven \u2013 De bloemen van het kwaad \u2013 Charles Baudelaire\n\n4\/ Ik had graag gezien \u2013 Isabelle Bielecki\n\n5\/ Exotisch parfum \u2013 De bloemen van het kwaad \u2013 Charles Baudelaire\n\n6\/ Een slang \u2013 Anne-Marie Der\u00e8se\n\n 7\/ Uit liefde \u2013 Nieuwste gedichten \u2013 Paul Eluard\n\n 8\/Ave \u2013 Catherine Pozzi\n\n9\/ Drie-eenheid \u2013 Michel Ducobu\n\nMuzieksonate \u201cAppassionata\u201d Op.140 \u2013 Sigfrid Karg-Elert\n\n10\/ Sentimentele conferentie \u2013 Les f\u00eate galantes \u2013 Paul Verlaine\n\n11 Schoonheid \u2013 De bloemen van het kwaad \u2013 Charles Baudelaire\n\nMuziek \u201cPreterition\u201d Creatie voor deze show door Michel Lysight\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-07-luxe-calme-et-volupte\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005875"}},"place":{"id":242272,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Atelier Marcel Hastir ist ein Ort der Kunst, der kulturellen und k\u00fcnstlerischen Begegnungen, der 1935 von dem Maler Marcel Hastir in seinem K\u00fcnstleratelier in der Rue du Commerce 51 eingerichtet wurde. Das ungew\u00f6hnliche Haus hei\u00dft seit Jahrzehnten inmitten der Kunstwerke sowohl junge K\u00fcnstler als auch gro\u00dfe Namen der belgischen und internationalen Musik- und Theaterszene willkommen - ein Ort, der mit seiner ganz besonderen Atmosph\u00e4re verzaubert.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Handelsstraat","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Handelsstraat, 51","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Atelier Marcel Hastir is a magical place where culture lovers and artists meet in the midst of Marcel Hastir's paintings, in the intimate setting of what has been his place of work since 1935.\r\nMarcel Hastir was a Belgian painter, theosofist and resistance fighter. His studio in the Leopold district served also as a concert hall for young musicians, and during the Second World War this \"painters school\" actually served as a relatively safe meeting place for young artists, students and resistance fighters. A team of passionate volunteers work for the preservation of his work and home organising concerts with both young and confirmed talent from Belgium and abroad.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","addres