, \u00e7a est un tof caberdouche !\nTu peux venir en famille, avec ta boma et ton bompa et m\u00eame les kets sont les bienvenus ! Tu dois pas avoir les poepers d'attraper la kiekebich, y aura du chauffage !\nTu pourras boire une bonne drache, m\u00eame deux !\nTu vas tomber de ta chaise de rire tellement on va raconter des carabistouilles et des zieverderaa !\nTu vas voir les meilleurs sketches de Monique & Suske et de Madame De Paeauw &\nMonsieur Peeters, plus des in\u00e9dits par-dessus le march\u00e9 !\nC'est d\u00e9j\u00e0 bon ou t'en veux encore ?","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fourire.be\/","email":"reservations@fourire.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005460"},"sp":{"name":"Home nuzel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fourire.be\/","email":"reservations@fourire.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005460"},"nl":{"name":"Home nuzel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fourire.be\/","email":"reservations@fourire.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005460"}},"place":{"id":249081,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue des Grenadiers, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue des Grenadiers, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Grenadierslaan","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Grenadierslaan, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue des Grenadiers, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue des Grenadiers, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Le Fou Rire Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue des Grenadiers, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Vous cherchez une soir\u00e9e pleine d'humour et de divertissement ? Vous \u00eates alors \u00e0 la bonne adresse (attention, celle-ci a chang\u00e9 en 2019). Par la d\u00e9tente, l'interaction et l'\u00e9motion, il vise \u00e0 relier les gens par et \u00e0 travers le th\u00e9\u00e2tre bruxellois et \u00e0 les renvoyer chez eux avec un sentiment de sati\u00e9t\u00e9 et d'exub\u00e9rance. Dans ce th\u00e9\u00e2tre de quartier, le texte et l'\u00e9motion occupent une place pr\u00e9pond\u00e9rante, car en plus de la com\u00e9die, retrouvez aussi de la po\u00e9sie, de la philosophie, des contes et du th\u00e9\u00e2tre jeune public.   \r\n\r\n ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Avenue des Grenadiers","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Avenue des Grenadiers, 48","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Fou Rire","address_street_name":"Grenadierslaan","address_street_number":"48","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fourire.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fourire.be","phone_contact":"+32 483 59 92 29","phone_booking":"+32 70 66 06 01","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Grenadierslaan, 48","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Op zoek naar een avond vol