"name":"Du Bout des L\u00e8vres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/duboutdeslevres","email":"riacarbonez@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 471 19 05 57","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003880"},"pt":{"name":"Du Bout des L\u00e8vres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/duboutdeslevres","email":"riacarbonez@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 471 19 05 57","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003880"},"en":{"name":"Du Bout des L\u00e8vres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/duboutdeslevres","email":"riacarbonez@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 471 19 05 57","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003880"},"it":{"name":"Du Bout des L\u00e8vres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/duboutdeslevres","email":"riacarbonez@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 471 19 05 57","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003880"},"cn":{"name":"Du Bout des L\u00e8vres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/duboutdeslevres","email":"riacarbonez@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 471 19 05 57","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003880"},"fr":{"name":"Du Bout des L\u00e8vres","shortdescr":"Quand l\u2019Afrique nous r\u00e9concilie avec nos corps\nDes origines de l\u2019homme et de la femme, \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de leur intimit\u00e9, Ria Carbonez vous propose une plong\u00e9e dans un spectacle \u00e9rotico afro-disiaque, empreint de tendresse, d\u2019amour et de sensibilit\u00e9.\nSpectacle r\u00e9serv\u00e9 \u00e0 un public averti (+16 ans)\n","longdescr":"Quand l\u2019Afrique nous r\u00e9concilie avec nos corps\nDu bout des l\u00e8vres vous convie \u00e0 un voyage en Afrique parsem\u00e9 d\u2019\u00e9clats de vie en Flandre. Un voyage jalonn\u00e9 de l\u00e9gendes, d\u2019histoires familiales simples, touchantes, remplies de tendresse, d\u2019amour et d\u2019\u00e9motions fortes.  \nCe spectacle parle, aussi, de sexualit\u00e9, avec des mots subtils empreints de po\u00e9sie.\nIl vous emm\u00e8ne sans d\u00e9tour \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de sensations universelles, \u00e9moustillantes et troublantes. \nLes personnages, dr\u00f4les, espi\u00e8gles et parfois cruels vous embarquent dans un jeu d\u2019allers-retours Afrique-Europe, avec, pour nommer les parties intimes, des mots originaux et \u00e9l\u00e9gants.\nSpectacle r\u00e9serv\u00e9 \u00e0 un public averti (+16 ans)\n","performers":"D\u2019origine belgo-congolaise, Ria Carbonez d\u00e9couvre la sc\u00e8ne il y a plus de 15 ans.\nRia choisit les th\u00e8mes de ses spectacles en fonction de son ressenti de femme, de ses pr\u00e9occupations de m\u00e8re et tout simplement d\u2019\u00eatre humain.\nEn 2019, elle re\u00e7oit le BRUKMER GOLDEN ARTISTIC AWARDS.\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/duboutdeslevres","email":"riacarbonez@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 471 19 05 57","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003880"},"sp":{"name":"Du Bout des L\u00e8vres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\/duboutdeslevres","email":"riacarbonez@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 471 19 05 57","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003880"},"nl":{"name":"Du Bout des L\u00e8vres","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/bit.ly\