ackoffice_id":315939,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"festival","ranking":0.8735804647362989,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en","es","pt","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":118,"translations":{"de":"Festival","pt":null,"en":"Festival","it":"Festival","cn":null,"fr":"Festival","sp":"Festival","nl":"Festival"}},"others":{"list":[125],"translations":{"de":["Chanson"],"pt":[null],"en":["Song"],"it":["Canzone"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Chanson"],"sp":["Chanson"],"nl":["Kleinkunst"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Fiesta Latina - Carnival Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":"green@beegroupe.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 63 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005273"},"pt":{"name":"Fiesta Latina - Carnival Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":"green@beegroupe.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 63 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005273"},"en":{"name":"Fiesta Latina - Carnival Edition","shortdescr":"FIESTA LATINA - CARNIVAL EDITION \nOn February 14, 15 and 16, 2025, experience 3 unforgettable days at Tour & Taxis, with parades, glittering costumes and frenzied rhythms! Over 40 stands, food trucks, activities, dancing and muy calientes after-parties! Don't miss the Latino festival of the winter! \nTour & Taxis, Brussels | Infos : www.fiesta-latina.be","longdescr":"FIESTA LATINA - CARNIVAL EDITION \nLast year, you celebrated a memorable carnival... Are you ready to do even better?\nFor the third year running, Fiesta Latina - CARNIVAL EDITION returns to Tour & Taxis for 3 unforgettable days: February 14, 15 and 16, 2025!\nGet ready for a sensational weekend filled with even grander parades, dazzling costumes and frenzied rhythms! Don't miss out on the spirit of Carnival: it's this winter's must-see festival! \nEmbark on a gustatory, auditory and visual immersion into the wonders of Latin America!\n\nON THE PROGRAM \n* 3 days of festive Latin ambience\n* More than 40 themed stands, bars and food trucks with South American flavours \n* Activities galore: colorful and majestic parades with 50 dancers and musicians for an even bigger show, extravagant costumes, wild dance classes, strolling shows, Latin music and many other surprises to immerse you in the Latin carnival world! \n* After-parties muy caliente to dance the night away! \n\n LINE-UP \nComing soon! Stay tuned to discover the artists who'll be setting this edition alight!\n\nPRACTICAL INFO\nDates: February 14, 15 and 16, 2025\n Opening hours :\n* Friday: 17:00 - 03:00\n* Saturday: 2pm - 3am\n* Sunday: 12:00 - 22:00\nVenue: Avenue du Port 86c, 1000 Brussels (SHED 1, Tour & Taxis)\n Parking :\n* Parking Esplanade (Avenue du Port 88, paying)\n* Parking Lane (Rue Picard 13, paying)\nLockers available on site (cash payment only)\nFree entry and exit with wristband\nReady to rock to the rhythm of Carnival? We're waiting for you for an explosive fiesta! ","performers":"Discover our program on our social networks","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":"green@beegroupe.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 63 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005273"},"it":{"name":"Fiesta Latina - Carnival Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":"green@beegroupe.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 63 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005273"},"cn":{"name":"Fiesta Latina - Carnival Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":"green@beegroupe.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 63 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005273"},"fr":{"name":"Fiesta Latina - Carnival Edition","shortdescr":"FIESTA LATINA \u2013 CARNIVAL EDITION \nLes 14, 15 et 16 f\u00e9vrier 2025, vivez 3 jours inoubliables \u00e0 Tour & Taxis avec parades, costumes scintillants et rythmes endiabl\u00e9s ! Plus de 40 stands, food trucks, activit\u00e9s, danse et after-parties muy calientes ! Ne manquez pas le festival latino de l\u2019hiver ! \nTour & Taxis, Bruxelles | Infos : www.fiesta-latina.be","longdescr":"FIESTA LATINA \u2013 CARNIVAL EDITION \nL'ann\u00e9e derni\u00e8re, vous avez c\u00e9l\u00e9br\u00e9 un carnaval m\u00e9morable\u2026 \u00cates-vous pr\u00eats \u00e0 faire encore mieux ?\nPour la troisi\u00e8me ann\u00e9e cons\u00e9cutive, Fiesta Latina - CARNIVAL EDITION revient \u00e0 Tour & Taxis et d\u00e9pose ses valises pour 3 jours inoubliables : les 14, 15 et 16 f\u00e9vrier 2025 !\nPr\u00e9parez-vous pour un week-end sensationnel rempli de parades encore plus grandioses, de costumes \u00e9tincelants et de rythmes endiabl\u00e9s ! Ne manquez pas l'esprit du carnaval : c\u2019est le festival incontournable de cet hiver ! \nEmbarquez pour une immersion gustative, auditive et visuelle au c\u0153ur des merveilles de l\u2019Am\u00e9rique latine !\n\nAU PROGRAMME \n* 3 jours d\u2019ambiance latine et festive\n* Plus de 40 stands th\u00e9matiques, bars et food trucks aux saveurs sud-am\u00e9ricaines \n*Des activit\u00e9s \u00e0 gogo : parades color\u00e9es et majestueuses avec 50 danseurs et musiciens pour un spectacle encore plus grandiose, costumes extravagants, cours de danse endiabl\u00e9s, spectacles d\u00e9ambulatoires, musique latine et bien d\u2019autres surprises pour vous plonger dans l\u2019univers carnavalesque latino ! \n* After-parties muy caliente pour danser jusqu\u2019au bout de la nuit ! \n\n LINE-UP \n\u00c0 venir tr\u00e8s bient\u00f4t ! Restez \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9coute pour d\u00e9couvrir les artistes qui enflammeront cette \u00e9dition !\n\nINFOS PRATIQUES\nDates : 14, 15 et 16 f\u00e9vrier 2025\n Horaires :\n* Vendredi : 17h00 \u2013 03h00\n* Samedi : 14h00 \u2013 03h00\n* Dimanche : 12h00 - 22h00\nLieu : Avenue du Port 86c, 1000 Bruxelles (SHED 1, Tour & Taxis)\n Parking :\n* Parking Esplanade (Avenue du Port 88, payant)\n* Parking Lane (Rue Picard 13, payant)\nLockers disponibles sur place (paiement en cash uniquement)\nEntr\u00e9e et sortie libres avec le bracelet\nPr\u00eats \u00e0 vibrer au rythme du carnaval ? On vous attend pour une fiesta explosive ! \n","performers":"Viens d\u00e9couvrir notre programmation sur nos r\u00e9seaux sociaux","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":"green@beegroupe.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 63 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005273"},"sp":{"name":"Fiesta Latina - Carnival Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":"green@beegroupe.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 63 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005273"},"nl":{"name":"Fiesta Latina - Carnival Edition","shortdescr":"FIESTA LATINA - CARNAVALSEDITIE \nGeniet op 14, 15 en 16 februari 2025 van 3 onvergetelijke dagen bij Tour & Taxis, met parades, schitterende kostuums en uitzinnige ritmes! Meer dan 40 kraampjes, foodtrucks, activiteiten, dans en muy calientes afterparties! Mis het Latino festival van de winter niet! \nTour & Taxis, Brussel | Info: www.fiesta-latina.be","longdescr":"FIESTA LATINA - CARNAVALSEDITIE \nVorig jaar vierde u een onvergetelijk carnaval... Bent u klaar om het nog beter te doen?\nVoor het derde achtereenvolgende jaar keert Fiesta Latina - CARNIVAL EDITION terug naar Tour & Taxis voor 3 onvergetelijke dagen: 14, 15 en 16 februari 2025!\nBereid je voor op een sensationeel weekend vol nog grootsere parades, oogverblindende kostuums en uitzinnige ritmes! Mis de geest van carnaval niet: dit is het must-see festival van deze winter! \nGa op een smakelijke, auditieve en visuele onderdompeling in de wonderen van Latijns-Amerika!\n\nOP HET PROGRAMMA \n* 3 dagen Latin en feestelijke sfeer\n* Meer dan 40 thematische stands, bars en foodtrucks met Zuid-Amerikaanse smaken \n* Activiteiten in overvloed: kleurrijke en majestueuze optochten met 50 dansers en muzikanten voor een nog grotere show, extravagante kostuums, wilde danslessen, straatshows, latin muziek en nog veel meer verrassingen om je onder te dompelen in de wereld van Latijns carnaval! \n* Afterparties muy caliente om de hele nacht door te dansen! \n\n LINE-UP \nBinnenkort beschikbaar! Blijf kijken welke artiesten deze editie in vuur en vlam zullen staan!\n\nPRAKTISCHE INFO\nData: 14, 15 en 16 februari 2025\n Openingstijden\n* Vrijdag: 17:00 - 03:00\n* Zaterdag: 14.00 - 03.00 uur\n* Zondag: 12u - 22u\nLocatie: Havenlaan 86c, 1000 Brussel (SHED 1, Tour & Taxis)\n Parkeren :\n* Parking Esplanade (Havenlaan 88, betalend)\n* Parking Lane (Picardstraat 13, betalend)\nKluisjes ter plaatse beschikbaar (alleen contante betaling)\nGratis in- en uitrijden met polsbandje\nKlaar om carnaval te vieren? Wij wachten op je voor een explosief feest! ","performers":"Ontdek ons programma op onze sociale netwerken","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":"green@beegroupe.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 63 20","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005273"}},"place":{"id":50002720,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Tour & Taxis - Shed 1","address_street_name":"Rue Picard","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"