ecently renovated and shining brighter than ever, this Brussels nightlife temple is ready to welcome us for a new incredible chapter of la noche muy picante !\nGet ready for a night full of glitter, energy, and that unique Gasolina vibe you love! We can\u2019t wait to reunite with our amazing crowd in this fabulous space. \n\nBe ready to make history with us ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/gasolina.brussels\/","email":"marcos.gasolina@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 80 97 67","phone_booking":"+32 470 80 97 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005988"},"it":{"name":"GASOLINA \u2022 Madame Moustache \u2022 \"Perreo With Love\" Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/gasolina.brussels\/","email":"marcos.gasolina@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 80 97 67","phone_booking":"+32 470 80 97 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005988"},"cn":{"name":"GASOLINA \u2022 Madame Moustache \u2022 \"Perreo With Love\" Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/gasolina.brussels\/","email":"marcos.gasolina@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 80 97 67","phone_booking":"+32 470 80 97 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005988"},"fr":{"name":"GASOLINA \u2022 Madame Moustache \u2022 \"Perreo With Love\" Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Apr\u00e8s une ann\u00e9e de nuits inoubliables \u00e0 l'iconique @spiritobrussels, Gasolina d\u00e9m\u00e9nage vers un tout nouvel \u00e9crin : le l\u00e9gendaire @madamemoustachebrussels !\nR\u00e9cemment r\u00e9nov\u00e9 et plus brillant que jamais, ce temple de la nuit bruxelloise est pr\u00eat \u00e0 nous accueillir pour un nouveau chapitre incroyable de la noche muy picante !\n\nPr\u00e9parez-vous pour une nuit pleine de paillettes, d'\u00e9nergie et de cette ambiance unique \u00e0 Gasolina que vous adorez. Nous avons h\u00e2te de retrouver notre public fantastique dans ce lieu fabuleux.\n\nSoyez pr\u00eats \u00e0 \u00e9crire l'histoire avec nous !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/gasolina.brussels\/","email":"marcos.gasolina@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 80 97 67","phone_booking":"+32 470 80 97 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005988"},"sp":{"name":"GASOLINA \u2022 Madame Moustache \u2022 \"Perreo With Love\" Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/gasolina.brussels\/","email":"marcos.gasolina@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 80 97 67","phone_booking":"+32 470 80 97 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005988"},"nl":{"name":"GASOLINA \u2022 Madame Moustache \u2022 \"Perreo With Love\" Edition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"GASOLINA x MADAME MOUSTACHE\n\nNa een jaar onvergetelijke avonden in de iconische @spiritobrussels verhuist Gasolina naar een gloednieuwe locatie: de legendarische @madamemoustachebrussels!\nRecent gerenoveerd en stralender dan ooit, is deze Brusselse nachttempel klaar om ons te verwelkomen voor een nieuw, ongelooflijk hoofdstuk van la noche muy picante!\n\nMaak je klaar voor een avond vol glitter, energie en die unieke Gasolina-sfeer waar je zo van houdt. We kunnen niet wachten om onze geweldige crowd te zien in deze prachtige ruimte.\n\nWees er klaar voor om samen met ons geschiedenis te schrijven!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/gasolina.brussels\/","email":"marcos.gasolina@hotmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 80 97 67","phone_booking":"+32 470 80 97 67","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005988"}},"place":{"id":248596,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Madame Moustache","address_street_name":"Quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler","address_street_number":"5-7","address_street_box":null,"email":"madamemoustachesprl@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/madamemoustache.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 489 10 05 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler, 5-7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Madame Moustache (\u00fcbersetzt Frau Schnurrbart\" oder die \u201eb\u00e4rtige Lady\")... ohne diesen skurrilen Club mit seinem pr\u00e4gnanten Motto \u201eno-bullshit\u201c w\u00e4re das Br\u00fcsseler Nachtleben sicherlich um einiges \u00e4rmer.\r\n\r\nBei Madame Moustache weht ein verruchtes Cabaret-L\u00fcftchen: Konzerte und DJ-Sets sorgen mit Good Vibes, 50\u2019s Rock\u2019n\u2019Roll, Soul, Funk & Retro dienstags bis samstags f\u00fcr Stimmung. \r\n\r\nUnd bei sch\u00f6nem Wetter kann man ab 13 Uhr auf der Terrasse Sonne tanken.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Madame Moustache","address_street_name":"Quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler","address_street_number":"5-7","address_street_box":null,"email":"madamemoustachesprl@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/madamemoustache.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 489 10 05 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler, 5-7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Madame Moustache","address_street_name":"Brandhoutkaai","address_street_number":"5-7","address_street_box":null,"email":"madamemoustachesprl@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/madamemoustache.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 489 10 05 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Brandhoutkaai, 5-7","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Madame Moustache ... We can barely imagine what life was like before this very quirky, temperamental, and moustachioed lady docked on the \u201cQuai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler\u201d. Rockabilly and, for anyone who has had enough of electronic beats and wants go back to the era of rock\u2018n roll, lindyhop and swing - but also garage, soul, funk, etc ... A cosy, hot dance bar with a very American interior.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Madame Moustache","address_street_name":"Quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler","address_street_number":"5-7","address_street_box":null,"email":"madamemoustachesprl@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/madamemoustache.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 489 10 05 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler, 5-7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Un must della vita notturna di Bruxelles, Madame Moustache \u00e8 un bar per cabaret, concerti rock e serate DJ che si svolgono dal marted\u00ec al sabato vicino a Place Sainte-Catherine, a partire dalle 18:00. Potete anche venire a fare un giro sulla terrazza del locale quando c'\u00e8 bel tempo, a partire dalle 13:00\r\nQuando: dalle 19:00 alle 4:00 del mattino\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Madame Moustache","address_street_name":"Quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler","address_street_number":"5-7","address_street_box":null,"email":"madamemoustachesprl@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/madamemoustache.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 489 10 05 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler, 5-7","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit"