ons":{"de":"Konzert","pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"de":["Klassisch"],"pt":[null],"en":["Classical"],"it":["Classica"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Classique"],"sp":["Cl\u00e1sica"],"nl":["Klassiek"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"4-hand piano duet: Virginia Corricelli & Laura Nunes - works by Schubert, Schumann and Debussy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-15-duo-piano-a-4-mains-virginia-corricelli-et-laura-nunes\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005907"},"pt":{"name":"4-hand piano duet: Virginia Corricelli & Laura Nunes - works by Schubert, Schumann and Debussy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-15-duo-piano-a-4-mains-virginia-corricelli-et-laura-nunes\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005907"},"en":{"name":"4-hand piano duet: Virginia Corricelli & Laura Nunes - works by Schubert, Schumann and Debussy","shortdescr":"Programme:\nSchubert - Fantasy in F minor\nBrahms - Variations on a theme by R. Schumann\npause\nDebussy - Six ancient epigraphs\nDebussy - Small suite\n ","longdescr":"Laura Nunes was born on 10 September 1999 in Aveiro. She began her musical studies at the age of 6, in the piano class of Professor Em\u00edlia Gon\u00e7alves, at the Conservat\u00f3rio de M\u00fasica deAveiro Caloust Gulbenkian. The following year, she joined the class of Professor Patr\u00edcia Sousa, with whom she studied until the age of 17, when she completed her studies at the Conservatory. In 2017, she began her studies at ESMAE, under Professor Constantin Sandu. She is currently in the final year of her Masters at the Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles, in the class of Professor Johan Schmidt. During her eighteen years of piano studies, Laura has taken part in several Master Classes with renowned pianists such as Paul Badura-Skoda, Imogen Cooper Cooper, Hortense Cartier-Bresson, Aleksandar Mad\u017ear, Paulo Oliveira, Luiz de Moura Castro, Artur Pizarro, Josep Colom  and Eldar Nebolsin. She has also taken part in several festivals, such as the \u00d3bidos International Piano Week - SIPO (2016), the Orihuela International Music Forum (2018 and 2019), the Summer Classical Festival and Academy (2028 and 2019) and the Nice International Summer Academy (2020), where she was invited to play in the Student Concert, recorded and broadcasted live. Laura has won prizes in local, national and international competitions. Laura performs regularly in public recitals, both as a soloist and as part of chamber music projects.\n\n Virginia Corricelli was born on 18 April 2000 in Foggia, Italy. She began her musical studies at the local private music school under the guidance of Maria Candelma. She obtained a bachelor's degree and a master's degree in piano at the Conservatorio di Musica U. Giordano Conservatory of Music in Foggia in the class of Professor Giuseppe Spagnoli, with first class honours. In 2019, she took a one-year private course with Andrew Wright in The Hague, Netherlands. In 2020, she will go on an Erasmus course at the Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles in the class of Professor Victor Chestopal, where she obtained her second Master's degree. During her years of piano studies, she has attended numerous masterclasses (Massimiliano G\u00e9not, Andrew Wright, Ellen Corver, Gianluca Luisi), Impressions (Julich, Germany), MusicAlta (Alsace, France). She is a very active pianist in the field of collaborative piano. She has performed with opera singers, duo and trio formations (from woodwind to string) and even with the Orchestra of the Italian National Police. As well as being a pianist, she is an active piano teacher in the Brussels region. Since 2021, she has been one of the two members of the Calliope duo.\n \n\n","performers":" Virginia Corricelli and Laura Nunes ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-15-duo-piano-a-4-mains-virginia-corricelli-et-laura-nunes\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005907"},"it":{"name":"4-hand piano duet: Virginia Corricelli & Laura Nunes - works by Schubert, Schumann and Debussy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-15-duo-piano-a-4-mains-virginia-corricelli-et-laura-nunes\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005907"},"cn":{"name":"4-hand piano duet: Virginia Corricelli & Laura Nunes - works by Schubert, Schumann and Debussy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-15-duo-piano-a-4-mains-virginia-corricelli-et-laura-nunes\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005907"},"fr":{"name":"Duo piano \u00e0 4 mains: Virginia Corricelli & Laura Nunes \u2013 oeuvres de Schubert, Schumann et Debussy","shortdescr":"Programme:\nSchubert \u2013 Fantasie en Fa mineur\nBrahms \u2013 Variations sur un th\u00e8me de R. Schumann\npause\nDebussy \u2013  Six \u00e9pigraphes antiques\nDebussy \u2013 Petite suite\n ","longdescr":"Laura Nunes est n\u00e9e le 10 septembre 1999 \u00e0 Aveiro. Elle a commenc\u00e9 ses \u00e9tudes musicales \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e2gede 6 ans, dans la classe de piano du professeur Em\u00edlia Gon\u00e7alves, au Conservat\u00f3rio de M\u00fasica deAveiro Caloust Gulbenkian. L\u2019ann\u00e9e suivante, elle rejoint la classe du professeur Patr\u00edcia Sousa, avec qui elle \u00e9tudie jusqu\u2019\u00e0 l\u2019\u00e2ge de 17 ans, date \u00e0 laquelle elle termine ses \u00e9tudes au Conservatoire. En 2017, elle d\u00e9bute ses \u00e9tudes \u00e0 l\u2019ESMAE, sous la direction du Professeur\nConstantin Sandu. Elle est actuellement en derni\u00e8re ann\u00e9e de Master au Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles, dans la classe du Professeur Johan Schmidt. Au cours de ses dix-huit ann\u00e9es d\u2019\u00e9tudes pianistiques, Laura a particip\u00e9 \u00e0 plusieurs Master Classes avec des pianistes de renom tels que Paul Badura-Skoda, Imogen Cooper Cooper, Hortense Cartier-Bresson, Aleksandar Mad\u017ear, Paulo Oliveira, Luiz de Moura Castro, Artur Pizarro, Josep Colom. et Eldar Nebolsin. Il a \u00e9galement particip\u00e9 \u00e0 plusieurs festivals, tels que la Semaine Internationale du Piano d\u2019\u00d3bidos \u2013 SIPO (2016),le Forum International de Musique d\u2019Orihuela (2018 et 2019), le Festival et Acad\u00e9mie Classiqued\u2019\u00c9t\u00e9 (2028 et 2019) et l\u2019Acad\u00e9mie Internationale d\u2019\u00c9t\u00e9 de Nice. (2020), o\u00f9 elle a \u00e9t\u00e9 invit\u00e9e \u00e0 jouer dans le Concert \u00e9tudiant, enregistr\u00e9 et diffus\u00e9 en direct. Laura a re\u00e7u des prix lors de concours locaux, nationaux et internationaux. Laura se produit r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement lors de r\u00e9citals publics, tant en solo que dans le cadre de projets de musique de chambre.\n\nVirginia Corricelli est n\u00e9e le 18 avril 2000 \u00e0 Foggia, en Italie. Elle a commenc\u00e9 ses \u00e9tudes musicales \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9cole de musique priv\u00e9e locale sous la direction de Maria Candelma. Elle a obtenu un baccalaur\u00e9at et un master en piano au Conservatoire de musique U. Giordano de Foggia dans la classe du professeur Giuseppe Spagnoli, avec mention tr\u00e8s bien. En 2019, elle a suivi un cours priv\u00e9 d\u2019un an avec Andrew Wright \u00e0 La Haye, aux Pays-Bas. En 2020, elle part en Erasmus au\nConservatoire royal de Bruxelles dans la classe du professeur Victor Chestopal, o\u00f9 elle obtient son deuxi\u00e8me Master. Au cours de ses ann\u00e9es d\u2019\u00e9tudes pianistiques, elle a suivi de nombreuses masterclass (Massimiliano G\u00e9not, Andrew Wright, Ellen Corver, Gianluca Luisi), Impressions (Julich, Allemagne), MusicAlta (Alsace, France). Elle est une pianiste tr\u00e8s active dans le domaine du piano collaboratif. Elle s\u2019est produite avec des chanteurs d\u2019op\u00e9ra, des formations en duo et en trio (des bois \u00e0 la formation \u00e0 cordes) et m\u00eame avec l\u2019Orchestre de la Police Nationale d\u2019Italie. En plus d\u2019\u00eatre pianiste, elle est professeur de piano actif dans la r\u00e9gion bruxelloise. Depuis 2021, elle est l\u2019une des deux membres du duo Calliope.\n","performers":"Virginia Corricelli et Laura Nunes ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-15-duo-piano-a-4-mains-virginia-corricelli-et-laura-nunes\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005907"},"sp":{"name":"4-hand piano duet: Virginia Corricelli & Laura Nunes - works by Schubert, Schumann and Debussy","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-15-duo-piano-a-4-mains-virginia-corricelli-et-laura-nunes\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005907"},"nl":{"name":"4-handig pianoduet: Virginia Corricelli & Laura Nunes - werken van Schubert, Schumann en Debussy","shortdescr":"Programma:\nSchubert - Fantasie in F klein\nBrahms - Variaties op een thema van R. Schumann\npauze\nDebussy - Zes antieke \u00e9pigraphes\nDebussy - Kleine suite\n ","longdescr":"Laura Nunes is geboren op 10 september 1999 in Aveiro. Ze begon haar muzikale studie op 6-jarige leeftijd in de pianoklas van professor Em\u00edlia Gon\u00e7alves aan het Conservat\u00f3rio de M\u00fasica de Aveiro Caloust Gulbenkian. Het jaar daarop kwam ze in de klas van professor Patr\u00edcia Sousa, bij wie ze studeerde tot haar 17e, toen ze haar studie aan het Conservatorium afrondde. In 2017 begon ze haar studie aan het ESMAE bij professor Constantin Sandu. Momenteel zit ze in het laatste jaar van haar Masters aan het Conservatoire Royal de Bruxelles, in de klas van professor Johan Schmidt. Tijdens haar achttien jaar durende pianostudie heeft Laura deelgenomen aan verschillende Master Classes met gerenommeerde pianisten zoals Paul Badura-Skoda, Imogen Cooper Cooper, Hortense Cartier-Bresson, Aleksandar Mad\u017ear, Paulo Oliveira, Luiz de Moura Castro, Artur Pizarro, Josep Colom en Eldar Nebolsin. Ze heeft ook deelgenomen aan verschillende festivals, zoals de \u00d3bidos International Piano Week - SIPO (2016), het Orihuela International Music Forum (2018 en 2019), het Summer Classical Festival and Academy (2028 en 2019) en de Nice International Summer Academy (2020), waar ze werd uitgenodigd om te spelen in het Student Concert, opgenomen en live uitgezonden. Laura heeft prijzen gewonnen in lokale, nationale en internationale competities. Laura treedt regelmatig op in openbare recitals, zowel solo als in kamermuziekprojecten.\n\nVirginia Corricelli werd geboren op 18 april 2000 in Foggia, Itali\u00eb. Ze begon haar muzikale studie aan de plaatselijke priv\u00e9 muziekschool onder leiding van Maria Candelma. Ze behaalde een bachelor's degree en een master's degree in piano aan het Conservatorio di Musica U. Giordano Conservatorium in Foggia in de klas van professor Giuseppe Spagnoli, met eerste klas onderscheidingen. In 2019 volgde ze een eenjarige priv\u00e9cursus bij Andrew Wright in Den Haag, Nederland. In 2020 volgt ze een Erasmuscursus aan het Koninklijk Conservatorium in Brussel. \nTijdens haar jarenlange pianostudie heeft ze talrijke masterclasses gevolgd (Massimiliano G\u00e9not, Andrew Wright, Ellen Corver, Gianluca Luisi), Impressions (Julich, Duitsland), MusicAlta (Elzas, Frankrijk). Ze is een zeer actieve pianiste op het gebied van collaborative piano. Ze heeft opgetreden met operazangers, duo en trio formaties (van houtblazers tot strijkers) en zelfs met het Orkest van de Italiaanse Nationale Politie. Naast pianiste is ze ook actief als pianolerares in de Brusselse regio. Sinds 2021 is ze een van de twee leden van het duo Calliope.\n\n ","performers":"Virginia Corricelli en Laura Nunes ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-15-duo-piano-a-4-mains-virginia-corricelli-et-laura-nunes\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005907"}},"place":{"id":242272,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Atelier Marcel Hastir ist ein Ort der Kunst, der kulturellen und k\u00fcnstlerischen Begegnungen, der 1935 von dem Maler Marcel Hastir in seinem K\u00fcnstleratelier in der Rue du Commerce 51 eingerichtet wurde. Das ungew\u00f6hnliche Haus hei\u00dft seit Jahrzehnten inmitten der Kunstwerke sowohl junge K\u00fcnstler als auch gro\u00dfe Namen der belgischen und internationalen Musik- und Theaterszene willkommen - ein Ort, der mit seiner ganz besonderen Atmosph\u00e4re verzaubert.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Handelsstraat","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Handelsstraat, 51","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Atelier Marcel Hastir is a magical place where culture lovers and artists meet in the midst of Marcel Hastir's paintings, in the intimate setting of what has been his place of work since 1935.\r\nMarcel Hastir was a Belgian painter, theosofist and resistance fighter. His studio in the Leopold district served also as a concert hall for young musicians, and during the Second World War this \"painters school\" actually served as a relatively safe meeting place for young artists, students and resistance fighters. A team of passionate volunteers work for the preservation of his work and home organising concerts with both young and confirmed talent from Belgium and abroad.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le nom Marcel Hastir vous dit quelque chose ?  Ce peintre, th\u00e9osophe et r\u00e9sistant belge a v\u00e9cu durant 76 ans (de 1935 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 sa mort) dans la rue du Commerce situ\u00e9e dans le quartier L\u00e9opold \u00e0 Bruxelles. Vous pouvez toujours y admirer ses toiles tout en appr\u00e9ciant de la musique classique ou du th\u00e9\u00e2tre. De grands noms du monde de la musique viennent dans ce lieu sp\u00e9cial depuis des d\u00e9cennies. L'atmosph\u00e8re intime et magique ne vous laissera pas indiff\u00e9rent.    \r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","addres