es histoires et des rencontres adapt\u00e9es \u00e0 la capitale. Apprenez tout sur le travail, les \u00e9tudes, et la vie \u00e0 Bruxelles et en Flandre. D\u00e9couvrez la richesse de l' offre culturelle n\u00e9erlandophone des organisations bruxelloises et flamandes.  ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Muntpunt","address_street_name":"Place de la Monnaie","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place de la Monnaie, 6","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Muntpunt ","address_street_name":"Muntplein","address_street_number":"6","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muntpunt.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muntpunt.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 278 11 11","phone_booking":"+32 2 278 11 11","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Muntplein, 6","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Muntpunt is een bibliotheek, informatiehuis, ontmoetingsplek en je venster op Brussel. Laat je inspireren door boeken, verhalen en ontmoetingen op maat van de hoofdstad. Kom meer te weten over wonen, werken, studeren, leven en beleven in Brussel en Vlaanderen. Ontdek het rijke Nederlandstalige culturele en vrijetijdsaanbod van Brusselse en Vlaamse organisaties.\r\n\r\nIn Muntpunt kan je meer dan alleen boeken, cd\u2019s en dvd\u2019s ontlenen. Je kan er ook terecht voor activiteiten, taalcursussen, infosessies, luisterboeken, strips, spelletjes, en nog veel meer. Er valt bijna dagelijks iets te beleven in Muntpunt, van voorlezen tot documentaires, van infosessies tot rondleidingen, voor jong en oud. De activiteiten sluiten aan bij de bibliotheekwerking of spelen in op actuele thema's, steeds met de Brusselse hoofdstedelijke context in het achterhoofd. De rode draad door de programmatie is de samenwerking met Vlaamse en Brusselse partnerorganisaties. \r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":13020,"location":{"lat":50.84996484,"lon":4.35348679},"last_updated_at":"2024-08-30T11:20:51+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:35:36+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[],"dates":[{"day":"2025-02-19","doors":null,"start":"16:00:00","end":"19:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Normal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"}},"value":0}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[]},{"id":5700005576,"date_start":"2025-02-19","date_end":"2025-02-22","date_next":"2025-02-19","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2025-01-27T12:39:26+01:00","published_at":"2025-01-17T12:12:14+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":316442,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"theatre","ranking":0.7937005259840998,"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"de":"Theater","pt":null,"en":"Theatre","it":"Teatro","cn":null,"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","sp":"Teatro","nl":"Theater"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Seigneur des Porcheries","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/maisonpoeme.be\/evenement\/2025-seigneur-des-porcheries\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005576"},"pt":{"name":"Seigneur des Porcheries","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/maisonpoeme.be\/evenement\/2025-seigneur-des-porcheries\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005576"},"en":{"name":"Seigneur des Porcheries","shortdescr":"Une pi\u00e8ce puissante, mordante et po\u00e9tique, qui explore la r\u00e9volte des laiss\u00e9s-pour-compte contre une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 au bord de l\u2019effondrement.","longdescr":"Une histoire de d\u00e9sob\u00e9issance et de r\u00e9volte sociale\nAdapt\u00e9e du roman de Tristan Egolf, cette \u00e9pop\u00e9e rock retrace le soul\u00e8vement d\u2019un paria et d\u2019une poign\u00e9e de marginalis\u00e9\u00b7es. Entre com\u00e9die noire et grotesque, elle interroge nos capacit\u00e9s de d\u00e9sob\u00e9issance et d\u2019action collective.\n\nUne exp\u00e9rience th\u00e9\u00e2trale brute et musicale\nDes compositions originales et une esth\u00e9tique saisissante au service d\u2019un r\u00e9cit contestataire.\n\nUne mise en sc\u00e8ne sign\u00e9e Nelly Framinet\nAvec son go\u00fbt pour l\u2019adaptation de romans et sa recherche de musicalit\u00e9 textuelle, Nelly Framinet livre une cr\u00e9ation \u00e0 la fois audacieuse et profond\u00e9ment humaine.","performers":"Avec : Olivier Chevillon, Marie Denys, Ga\u00e9tan Lejeune et Sophie Jaskulski","boxoffice_url":null,"website"