","email":"info@escaledunord.net","phone_contact":"+32 496 94 43 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005403"},"fr":{"name":"Iphig\u00e9nie \u00e0 Splott \u00b7 Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Poche \/ Cie Belle de Nuit","shortdescr":"Un spectacle nomm\u00e9 au Prix Maeterlinck 2022 dans les cat\u00e9gories Meilleur spectacle et Meilleure interpr\u00e9tation.","longdescr":"Effie habite \u00e0 Splott, un quartier de Cardiff, au Pays de Galles, min\u00e9 par la fermeture des usines, le ch\u00f4mage et la pr\u00e9carit\u00e9. Effie, c\u2019est le genre de fille qu\u2019on \u00e9vite de regarder dans les yeux car on a l\u2019impression qu\u2019elle va nous exploser au visage. Effie, on croit la conna\u00eetre, mais on n\u2019en conna\u00eet pas la moiti\u00e9\u2026\n\nTous les lundis, elle picole et se came comme une sauvage, et \u00e9merge au bout de trois jours d\u2019une gueule de bois pire que la mort. Pour mieux recommencer. Un personnage de d\u00e9mesure qu\u2019on croirait sorti d\u2019une trag\u00e9die grecque. Et puis, un soir, l\u2019occasion lui est offerte d\u2019\u00eatre autre chose que \u00e7a\u2026\n\nTraduction Blandine P\u00e9lissier et Kelly Rivi\u00e8re | Mise en sc\u00e8ne Georges Lini | Avec Gwendoline Gauthier | Collaboration artistique S\u00e9bastien Fernandez | Direction musicale Fran\u00e7ois Sauveur | Musiciens Pierre Constant, Julien Lemonnier \/ Simon Cogels \/ Geronimo De Halleux (en alternance) et Fran\u00e7ois Sauveur | Cr\u00e9ation lumi\u00e8res J\u00e9r\u00f4me Dejean | Costumes Charly Kleinermann et Thibaut De Coster\nUne coproduction du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Poche et de la Cie Belle de Nuit.\nTexte traduit avec le soutien de la Maison Antoine Vitez, Centre international de la traduction th\u00e9\u00e2trale. L\u2019auteur est repr\u00e9sent\u00e9 par MCR Agence Litt\u00e9raire.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaledunord.brussels\/event\/iphigenie-a-splott\/","email":"info@escaledunord.net","phone_contact":"+32 496 94 43 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005403"},"sp":{"name":"Iphig\u00e9nie \u00e0 Splott","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaledunord.brussels\/event\/iphigenie-a-splott\/","email":"info@escaledunord.net","phone_contact":"+32 496 94 43 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005403"},"nl":{"name":"Iphig\u00e9nie \u00e0 Splott","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/escaledunord.brussels\/event\/iphigenie-a-splott\/","email":"info@escaledunord.net","phone_contact":"+32 496 94 43 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005403"}},"place":{"id":271954,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Auditorium Jacques Brel","address_street_name":"Avenue Emile Gryson","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"auditoriumjb@ceria.be","website":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 526 70 20","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Avenue Emile Gryson, 1","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Auditorium Jacques Brel","address_street_name":"Avenue Emile Gryson","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":"auditoriumjb@ceria.be","website":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 526 70 20","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1070","address_city":"Anderlecht","address_line1":"Avenue Emile Gryson, 1","address_line2":"1070 Anderlecht","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Auditorium Jacques Brel","address_street_name":"Avenue 