 in, breathe, and take a moment to simply be.\n\n15:00 \u2013 16:00 | Silent Hour\nRead. Draw. Write. Knit. Or simply take in the sweeping view of Brussels. This time is yours. Candles will be lit to mark the beginning of silence.\n\n16:00 \u2013 17:00 | Offline Caf\u00e9 Atmosphere\nSpend this last hour as you wish. Share a quiet moment with friends, start a conversation, or embrace solitude at your own pace.\n\nWhat to Bring\nA book, a notebook, or creative tools for Silent Hour. An open mind. :)\n\nThe Venue\nLe Perch\u00e9\u2014a rooftop hideaway in the heart of Brussels, offering breathtaking views and a peaceful atmosphere. The perfect setting for an offline experience. A bar will be available, serving a selection of hot and cold drinks to accompany your moment.\n\nTickets\nLimited spots available. Reserve now to escape the noise and embrace the present.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lu.ma\/4u5edmow","email":"steven@beoffline.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006043"},"it":{"name":"BXL sans tel'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lu.ma\/4u5edmow","email":"steven@beoffline.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006043"},"cn":{"name":"BXL sans tel'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lu.ma\/4u5edmow","email":"steven@beoffline.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700006043"},"fr":{"name":"BXL sans tel'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lu.ma\/4u5edmow","email":"steven@beoffline.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail