ne_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 640 01 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005247"},"en":{"name":"Carnival at the Children's Museum !","shortdescr":"Carnival at the Children's Museum: You Are a Work of Art!\nDive into a creative universe with our interactive exhibition and explore our brand new \"Balance\" room, where art meets adventure!\n\n","longdescr":"Carnival at the Children's Museum: You Are a Work of Art!\nDive into a creative universe with our interactive exhibition and explore our brand new \"Balance\" room, where art meets adventure!\n\nThis holiday, become the artist of your own masterpiece by participating in our workshops:\n\nCraft Workshop: Create your personalized frame.\nCooking Workshop: Make a delicious paint palette.\nTheater Workshop: Step into the shoes of famous characters.\nAnd many more fun activities on the theme of art, painting, and creativity are waiting for you!\n\nAn inspiring holiday to awaken the artist within you!\n\nExhibition and workshop reservations on the website.\nWorkshop reservations on-site at 2:30 pm, subject to availability.\n\nExceptionally open on Monday mornings (24\/02 & 03\/03) from 10:00 to 12:30 and from 14:30 to 17:00.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be\/","email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 640 01 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005247"},"it":{"name":"Carnival Holidays at the Children's Museum!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be\/","email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 640 01 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005247"},"cn":{"name":"Carnival Holidays at the Children's Museum!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be\/","email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 640 01 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005247"},"fr":{"name":"Vacances de Carnaval au Mus\u00e9e des Enfants !","shortdescr":"Carnaval au Mus\u00e9e des Enfants : Tu es une \u0153uvre d'art !\nPlongez dans un univers cr\u00e9atif gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 notre exposition interactive et explorez notre toute nouvelle salle \u00e9quilibre, o\u00f9 l'art rencontre l'aventure ! ","longdescr":"Carnaval au Mus\u00e9e des Enfants : Tu es une \u0153uvre d'art !\nPlongez dans un univers cr\u00e9atif gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 notre exposition interactive et explorez notre toute nouvelle salle \u00e9quilibre, o\u00f9 l'art rencontre l'aventure ! \n\nCes vacances, devenez les artistes de votre propre chef-d'\u0153uvre en participant \u00e0 nos ateliers :\n\n- Atelier bricolage : fabriquez votre cadre personnalis\u00e9.\n- Atelier cuisine : r\u00e9alisez une palette de peinture gourmande.\n- Atelier th\u00e9\u00e2tre : prenez vie dans la peau de personnages c\u00e9l\u00e8bres.\n\nEt bien d'autres activit\u00e9s ludiques sur le th\u00e8me de l\u2019art, de la peinture et de la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 vous attendent !\n\nDes vacances pleinement inspir\u00e9es pour \u00e9veiller l\u2019artiste qui sommeille en vous !\n\nR\u00e9servations de l'exposition et des ateliers sur le site web.\nR\u00e9servations des ateliers sur place \u00e0 14h30 en fonction des disponibilit\u00e9s.  \n> Ouvert exceptionnellement les lundis matins (24\/02 & 03\/03) de 10h00 \u00e0 12h30 et de 14h30 \u00e0 17h00","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be\/","email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 640 01 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005247"},"sp":{"name":"Carnival Holidays at the Children's Museum!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be\/","email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 640 01 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005247"},"nl":{"name":"Krokusvakantie in het Kindermuseum !","shortdescr":"Carnaval in het Kindermuseum: Jij bent een kunstwerk !\nDuik in een creatieve wereld met onze interactieve tentoonstelling en ontdek onze gloednieuwe balanszaal, waar kunst en avontuur samenkomen !","longdescr":"Krokusvakantie in het Kindermuseum: Jij bent een kunstwerk !\nDuik in een creatieve wereld met onze interactieve tentoonstelling en ontdek onze gloednieuwe balanszaal, waar kunst en avontuur samenkomen ! \n\nDeze vakantie word jij de artiest van je eigen meesterwerk door deel te nemen aan onze workshops:\n\n- Knutselworkshop: maak je eigen gepersonaliseerde lijst.\n- Kookworkshop: maak een smakelijk schilderpalet.\n- Theaterworkshop: kom tot leven als beroemde personages.\n\nEn nog veel meer leuke activiteiten rond kunst, schilderen en creativiteit wachten op je !\n\nEen vakantie vol inspiratie om de artiest in jezelf wakker te maken !\n\nReserveringen voor de tentoonstelling en workshops via de website.\nReserveringen voor de workshops ter plaatse om 14u30, afhankelijk van de beschikbaarheid.\n\nUitzonderlijk geopend op maandagochtenden (24\/02 & 03\/03) van 10.00 tot 12.30 uur en van 14.30 tot 17.00 uur.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be\/","email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 640 01 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005247"}},"place":{"id":207541,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e des Enfants - das Br\u00fcsseler Kindermuseum","address_street_name":"Rue du Bourgmestre","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue du Bourgmestre, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Das Br\u00fcsseler Kindermuseum pr\u00e4sentiert in seinem stattlichen Herrenhaus in der Gemeinde Ixelles wechselnde thematische Ausstellungen f\u00fcr wissbegierige Kinder. Auf den 600 m\u00b2 Ausstellungsfl\u00e4che gibt es ganz sicher weder Computer noch Spielekonsolen, daf\u00fcr aber Holzspiele und spannende Installationen, die die Neugierde anregen und den Entdeckergeist wecken. Das Konzept, das - in Zusammenarbeit mit Kinderpsychologen - von dem Kindermuseum selbst entwickelt wurde, legt ein besonderes Augenmerk auf den Dialog zwischen Eltern und Kindern.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e des Enfants","address_street_name":"Rue du Bourgmestre","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue du Bourgmestre, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Children\u2019s Museum","address_street_name":"rue du Bourgmestre","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"rue du Bourgmestre, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Pioneer in Europe, The Children\u2019s Museum is located in a beautiful mansion which offers a 600m2 exhibition spaces. In this educational environment, where playing has a key role, you won\u2019t find computers nor video games. Stage settings and scenery, wooden toys, workshops are but some examples of the different means the Museum has put in place to help children in the discovery of the world that surrounds them, as well as themselves. Every exhibition is an exclusive creation that benefits from the guidance of various external specialists in different areas of the educational work fields.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Il Museo del Bambini di Bruxelles","address_street_name":"rue du Bourgmestre","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"rue du Bourgmestre, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e des Enfants","address_street_name":"Rue du Bourgmestre","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue du Bourgmestre, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e des Enfants","address_street_name":"Rue du Bourgmestre","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue du Bourgmestre, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Le Mus\u00e9e des Enfants est pionnier en Europe. \r\nInstall\u00e9 dans une magnifique maison appartenant \u00e0 la commune d\u2019Ixelles, le mus\u00e9e dispose de 600m\u00b2 d\u2019exposition. Dans cet espace d\u2019\u00e9ducation par le jeu, pas d\u2019ordinateur ni de console vid\u00e9o, mais des d\u00e9cors, des jeux en bois et des mises en situation qui permettent \u00e0 l\u2019enfant de d\u00e9couvrir et d\u2019approfondir la connaissance de soi et du monde qui l\u2019entoure. Chaque exposition se veut participative et ludique, avec un accent important mis sur le dialogue parents-enfants. Il s'agit \u00e0 chaque fois d'une cr\u00e9ation et d'une r\u00e9alisation enti\u00e8rement originale de l\u2019\u00e9quipe du Mus\u00e9e des Enfants, conseill\u00e9e par de nombreux sp\u00e9cialistes tel que p\u00e9dopsychiatres et psychologues.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"El Museo de los Ni\u00f1os de Bruselas","address_street_name":"rue du Bourgmestre","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.museedesenfants.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"rue du Bourgmestre, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Pionero en europa, el Museo de los Ni\u00f1os se sit\u00faa en una bella mansi\u00f3n que ofrece unos 600m\u00b2 de espacios de exhibici\u00f3n. En un ambiente educativo, donde jugar tiene un papel clave, no encontramos ni ordenadores ni videojuegos. Escenarios y decorados esc\u00e9nicos, mu\u00f1ecos de madera o talleres son s\u00f3lo algunas de la herramientas que el museo utiliza para ayudar a los ni\u00f1os a descubrir el mundo que les rodea, as\u00ed como a ellos mismos. Cada exhibici\u00f3n es una creaci\u00f3n exclusiva que se beneficia de la orientaci\u00f3n de varios especialistas de diferentes \u00e1reas de los campos del trabajo educativo.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Kindermuseum","address_street_name":"Burgemeestersstraat","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@childrenmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kindermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 640 01 07","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Burgemeestersstraat, 15","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Het Kindermuseum is een ware Europese pionnier. \r\nGevestigd in een prachtig herenhuis met een totale tentoonstellingsoppervlakte van 600 m\u00b2 illustreert het Kindermuseum door middel van haar tentoonstellingen en activiteiten de filosofie dat voor de vorming en ontwikkeling van een goede wereldori\u00ebntatie de participatieve en psychologische dimensie echt wezenlijk is. In deze ruimtes vind je nochtans geen virtuele, noch hoogtechnologische snufjes: het kind wordt in een herkenbare en re\u00eble spelsituatie geplaatst dankzij de decors en de houten spelletjes die de zelfkennis, de kennis van de ander en van de omringende wereld stimuleren. Het Museum biedt ludieke tentoonstellingen aan waarin de deelname en de dialoog volwassene\/ouder-kinderen een zeer belangrijke rol spelen.  Bij het creatieproces van elke tentoonstelling wordt de raad ingewonnen van  externe specialisten zoals kinderartsen, -psychiaters en -psychologen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[5],"translations":{"de":["Flagey"],"pt":[null],"en":["Flagey"],"it":["Flagey"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Flagey"],"sp":["Flagey"],"nl":["Flagey"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":460,"location":{"lat":50.82162501,"lon":4.