"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Just Vox","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/just-vox\/2025-02-25\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004950"},"pt":{"name":"Just Vox","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/just-vox\/2025-02-25\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004950"},"en":{"name":"Just Vox","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/just-vox\/2025-02-25\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004950"},"it":{"name":"Just Vox","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/just-vox\/2025-02-25\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004950"},"cn":{"name":"Just Vox","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/just-vox\/2025-02-25\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004950"},"fr":{"name":"Just Vox","shortdescr":"Fans d'a cappella et de beatboxing, ce concert du groupe belge Just Vox est pour vous !","longdescr":"Pas d'instrument, juste quatre voix (Valentine Uytterhoeven, Oriane Simon, V\u00e9ronique Schotte et Philippe Lombet) et un beatboxer (BigBen) aux univers distincts qui se rassemblent pour n'en former plus qu'un. La sp\u00e9cialit\u00e9 de Just Vox est surtout de r\u00e9inventer, par des arrangements originaux, des chansons de tous genres et de vous offrir ainsi un r\u00e9pertoire in\u00e9dit. Avec leur \u00e9nergie, ces chanteur\u00b7euses vous font voyager \u00e0 travers les \u00e9poques et les styles et vous embarquent dans un tourbillon de musique et d\u2019harmonies, avec une touche d\u2019humour. Red\u00e9couvrez les grands standards pop comme vous ne les avez jamais entendus !\n\nQuatre voix et une infinit\u00e9 de possibilit\u00e9s\n\n\nLa voix offre de nombreuses alternatives de sons. Nos quatre chanteur\u00b7euses explorent le potentiel de leur timbre et ne sont pas seulement des voix mais aussi des guitares, des basses, des trompettes, des claviers. Leurs cordes vocales deviennent ainsi un v\u00e9ritable orchestre et offrent un moment musical totalement \u00e0 part.\n\nBigBen : un beatboxer, v\u00e9ritable batterie humaine\n\nNotre beatboxer compl\u00e8te cet orchestre vocal. Le beatboxing est une forme de percussion vocale impliquant principalement l'art de produire des battements de batterie, du rythme, des sons musicaux et des bruitages sonores en utilisant la bouche, les l\u00e8vres, la langue et la voix.\n\nJust Vox, \u00e7a vous dit d\u00e9j\u00e0 quelque chose ? C'est un groupe belge qui a particip\u00e9 \u00e0 \u00ab La France a un incroyable talent \u00bb o\u00f9 ils sont arriv\u00e9s en demi-finale. Venez les d\u00e9couvrir en live dans la grande salle du Jacques Franck pour un concert qui s'annonce m\u00e9morable !","performers":"Voix : Valentine Uytterhoeven, Oriane Simon, V\u00e9ronique Schotte et Philippe Lombet\nBeatbox : BigBen\nSon : Yves Schotte\nLumi\u00e8re : Robin Van Bakel","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/just-vox\/2025-02-25\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004950"},"sp":{"name":"Just Vox","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/just-vox\/2025-02-25\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004950"},"nl":{"name":"Just Vox","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/just-vox\/2025-02-25\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700004950"}},"place":{"id":4,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Jacques Franck","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"94","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 94","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel Jacques Franck","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"94","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo, 94","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,