@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011587"},"en":{"name":"Les 39 Marches","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/les-39-marches\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011587"},"it":{"name":"Les 39 Marches","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/les-39-marches\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011587"},"cn":{"name":"Les 39 Marches","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/les-39-marches\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011587"},"fr":{"name":"Les 39 Marches","shortdescr":"\u00c7a montera en suspense !","longdescr":"L\u2019ascension continue ! Apr\u00e8s son carton la saison derni\u00e8re, Les 39 Marches, inspir\u00e9 du roman d\u2019espionnage de John Buchan, continue de jouer les prolongations ! Notre conseil reste le m\u00eame : tenez-vous \u00e0 la rampe ! Car vous n\u2019\u00eates pas pr\u00eat\u00b7e\u00b7s\u2026\n\nSur sc\u00e8ne, quatre com\u00e9diens cam\u00e9l\u00e9ons incarnent 36 personnages, dans une performance \u00e9chevel\u00e9e aussi physique que schizophr\u00e9nique o\u00f9 ils n\u2019auront pas le temps de souffler\u2026 Et vous non plus ! Appr\u00eatez-vous \u00e0 d\u00e9valer quatre \u00e0 quatre cette mise en sc\u00e8ne en colima\u00e7on qui donne \u00e0 voir un encha\u00eenement jubilatoire d\u2019accidents sans garde-corps.\n\nLe r\u00e9sultat ? Un th\u00e9\u00e2tre d\u2019action virtuose proche du music-hall, cadenc\u00e9 par un suspense hitchcockien (bah oui forc\u00e9ment\u2026) et insuffl\u00e9 d\u2019un humour so british qui ne fait pas, lui, dans l\u2019esprit d\u2019escalier. Please mind the gap !\n\n\nAdaptation Patrick Barlow Du roman de John Buchan \u00c0 partir du film de Alfred Hitchcock Mise en sc\u00e8ne Thibaut N\u00e8ve Avec Julie Lenain, Thibault Packeu, St\u00e9phane Pirard et Elsa Tarlton Sc\u00e9nographie et costumes Sofia Dilinos Cr\u00e9ation lumi\u00e8re Alain Collet Cr\u00e9ation sonore Laurent Beumier Production Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Toison d\u2019Or \u00a9 Photo Lou Verschueren Sous licence de ITV Global Entertainment Limited Concept original Simon Corble et Nobby Dimon Adaptation fran\u00e7aise G\u00e9rald Sibleyras","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/les-39-marches\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011587"},"sp":{"name":"Les 39 Marches","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/les-39-marches\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011587"},"nl":{"name":"Les 39 Marches","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ttotheatre.com\/spectacle\/les-39-marches\/","email":"info@ttotheatre.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 510 05 10","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011587"}},"place":{"id":227607,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Toison d'Or","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Toison d'Or","address_street_number":"396","address_