"translations":{"de":["Puppentheater"],"pt":[null],"en":["Puppet show"],"it":["Teatro delle marionette"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de marionnettes"],"sp":["Teatro de marionetas"],"nl":["Poppentheater"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Bleu grenouille \/\/ TOM Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000385"},"pt":{"name":"Bleu grenouille \/\/ TOM Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000385"},"en":{"name":"Bleu grenouille \/\/ TOM Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000385"},"it":{"name":"Bleu grenouille \/\/ TOM Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000385"},"cn":{"name":"Bleu grenouille \/\/ TOM Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000385"},"fr":{"name":"Bleu grenouille \/\/ TOM Festival","shortdescr":"Les spectacles du TOM Festival donnent la parole \u00e0 ceux et celles qui ne l\u2019ont pas : animaux, objets, nature. Ces autres ont beaucoup \u00e0 nous dire \u2013 sur notre mani\u00e8re d\u2019\u00eatre au monde. Sachons nous mettre \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9coute de ce qui nous environne, \u00e0 hauteur d\u2019enfant, pour capter l\u2019infinie fragilit\u00e9 des cohabitants de la Terre.","longdescr":"\nBleu grenouille \/\/ TOM Festival\n Th\u00e9\u00e2tre d'objet\n\nUn spectacle vivifiant, questionnant, la fleur au fusil, le rapport de l\u2019homme \u00e0 la Nature.\n\nBienvenue dans le monde color\u00e9 et singulier des zones humides, des \u00e9cosyst\u00e8mes peu connus, parmi les plus riches au monde, v\u00e9ritables puits de carbone, qui disparaissent \u00e0 grande vitesse.\nBleu est une enfant du pays qui chausse ses bottes d\u00e8s qu\u2019elle peut, enfourche son v\u00e9lo et s\u2019aventure entre ciel, terre et eau, en pleine nature, dans ce fabuleux terrain de jeu, de frisson et d\u2019audace. Mais, aujourd\u2019hui, quelqu\u2019un l\u2019observe ...\nUne plong\u00e9e onirique et d\u00e9cal\u00e9e dans une nature surprenante et fourmillante de vie, un royaume intriguant et enchanteur, jonch\u00e9 de for\u00eats, tourbi\u00e8res et roseli\u00e8res, o\u00f9 h\u00e9rons, libellules, \u00e9pinoches et crapauds sonneur \u00e0 ventre jaune, coulent des jours heureux \u2026 pas si tranquilles !\nUne cr\u00e9ation po\u00e9tiquement sauvage et d\u00e9licieusement aquatique. Subversive, l\u00e9g\u00e8re et fleurie.","performers":"Ecriture, graphisme, jeu et marionnette G\u00e9raldine Carpentier\u2013Dor\u00e9\nRegard ext\u00e9rieur en th\u00e9\u00e2tre d\u2019objet St\u00e9phane Georis\nUnivers graphique G\u00e9raldine Carpentier Dor\u00e9\nConstruction Marionnette G\u00e9raldine Carpentier avec la participation de Vittalia Samuilova ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000385"},"sp":{"name":"Bleu grenouille \/\/ TOM Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000385"},"nl":{"name":"Bleu grenouille \/\/ TOM Festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","email":"reservation@ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 04 95","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000385"}},"place":{"id":7929,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Uccle","address_street_name":"Rue Rouge","address_street_number":"47","address_street_box":null,"email":"reservation@ccu.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccu.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 374 64 84","phone_booking":"+32 2 374 64 84","address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Rue Rouge, 47","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Le Centre culturel d\u2019Uccle est contemporain de l\u2019Atomium. Con\u00e7u pour se trouver dans un \u00e9crin de verdure, face au Parc de Wolvendael, la premi\u00e8re pierre fut pos\u00e9e le 30 novembre 1957. Le Centre Culturel et Artistique d\u2019Uccle fut inaugur\u00e9 le 5 octobre 1958.\r\nLe CCU est une \u0153uvre de l\u2019architecte L\u00e9on Stynen, qui avait aussi con\u00e7u les casinos de Knokke, Blankenberge et Ostende.\r\nCe nouveau Centre Culturel permit aux soci\u00e9t\u00e9s et associations int\u00e9ress\u00e9es d\u2019organiser des bals, des conf\u00e9rences, des concerts, des projections de films, des d\u00e9bats et toutes autres manifestations culturelles et artistiques (ballets, concerts, expositions, r\u00e9ceptions, \u2026). Il proposait aussi des repr\u00e9sentations th\u00e9\u00e2trales, un cycle de conf\u00e9rences et des spectacles musicaux.\r\nL'ensemble du b\u00e2timent abrite principalement un hall d\u2019entr\u00e9e donnant acc\u00e8s \u00e0 une grande Salle de Spectacle de 800 fauteuils, un Grand Foyer pouvant accueillir jusqu'\u00e0 400 personnes assises, ainsi qu'un Petit Foyer pouvant contenir 120 personnes.\r\nPlus de cinquante ans apr\u00e8s sa cr\u00e9ation, le Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle r\u00e9nov\u00e9 a un look \u00e0 la fois contemporain et chaleureux. Pleinement actif, il r\u00e9pond aux d\u00e9fis culturels de son si\u00e8cle en accueillant les plus grands noms du th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de la danse, de la chanson et de la musique ainsi que des artistes et des conf\u00e9renciers de renom. Il s\u2019est constamment modernis\u00e9 pour offrir \u00e0 son public une vie culturelle de qualit\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de la commune d\u2019Uccle.\r\nDirig\u00e9 par une \u00e9quipe dynamique, le CCU met tout en \u0153uvre pour fid\u00e9liser sa client\u00e8le et conqu\u00e9rir sans cesse un public nouveau.\r\nLe Centre Culturel d\u2019Uccle en quelques chiffres, c\u2019est\u2026\r\n-\tUn des plus grands centres culturels \u00e0 Bruxelles et ses environs\r\n-\tUn rendez-vous des professionnels du spectacle\r\n-\t4 espaces bien distincts (Hall, Grand Foyer, Petit Foyer, Salle de Spectacle)\r\n-\tUne salle de spectacle de 800 places\r\n-\tUn gradin r\u00e9tractable de 172 places\r\n-\t200 activit\u00e9s par an\r\n-\t600 artistes par saison\r\n-\t60.000 spectateurs par an\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,