25-02-05","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":true,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2025-02-02T01:01:16+01:00","published_at":"2024-11-21T11:26:03+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":312265,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"other","ranking":0.2936303671325454,"languages":{"spoken":["nl","en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[44,36],"translations":{"de":["Design","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Design","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Design","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Design","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Dise\u00f1o","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Design","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/duos-resonances","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003836"},"pt":{"name":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/duos-resonances","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003836"},"en":{"name":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances","shortdescr":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances is an exhibition that aims to strengthen the dialogue between craft and design. ","longdescr":"From molded glass wafers to embroidery based on a computer-generated pattern. The exhibition Duos en R\u00e9sonances features the work of 6 designers and 6 artisans.\n\nDuos en R\u00e9sonances is a project of Wallonie Design created in 2017, supported by the Sofina&Bo\u00ebl Fund for Training and Talent since 2020. For six months, six duos of craft artists and designers work on the development of a joint project or idea. The designer gets to work directly with an expert in materials and techniques. In turn, the artisan discovers a different approach or working method that challenges him to step outside his daily professional practice. From December 6 to February 22, the results of the six collaborations will be exhibited to the general public at MAD Brussels.\n\nAN EXHIBITION WITH\n\u2014 Julien Renault (product designer) & Angel Barrero (plasterer)\n\u2014 Unfold (designers\/researchers) & Frederik Rombach (glassblower)\n\u2014 Gaston Golstein (industrial designer at Duplex Studio) & \u00c9tienne Guillaume (specialist in raw soil at Elementerre)\n\u2014 Flora Miranda (fashion designer) & Kenny Damian (embroiderer)\n\u2014 Frederik Delbart (industrial designer) & John Dierickx (stained glass at Studio Artglas)\n\u2014 Alice Pilastre (textile designer) & Julien Moermans (tufter)\n\nTHE SIX DUOS\nAfter a call for applications, six duos were formed who would each embark on their own unique project. From glass wafers to a new lighting element to an experimental stool. The duo Angel Barrero and Julien Renault wanted to apply the technique of marble stucco to a free form. By departing from the habits imposed by technique and approaching the material in a rougher and more radical way, they offer a new view of a careful and meticulous practice that dates back to the 16th century. The collaboration between Kenny Damian and Flora Miranda highlights a form of interconnected duality between computer-generated pattern and hand-embroidery. In turn, Etienne Guillaume and Duplex Studio (Gaston Golstein) translated the pis\u00e9 technique from construction to the production of an object. During the course of the project, they questioned the life cycle and the end of the useful life of a finished piece of raw earth.\n\nThe collaboration between Frederik Rombach and Unfold (Claire Warnier and Dries Verbruggen), is based on the symbolism of the Belgian waffle. By moulding waffles out of glass, they playfully demonstrate how they fit together and become connectors with other materials. Furthermore, the duo Julien Moermans and Alice Pilastre investigated the lifespan of tapestries and their materials. By omitting certain finishes and fraying the carpet, its structure will evolve through use and eventually disappear. Lastly, the duo John Dierickx and Frederik Delbart deconstruct the familiar traits of two-dimensional stained-glass and reimagine them as three-dimensional objects, uncovering new perspectives and surprising angles along the way.\n\nSCENOGRAPHY\nWith the support of the F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles, the scenography of the exhibition is entrusted to Brussels-based design studio Studio Plastique. The scenography reflects the experimental nature of Duos en R\u00e9sonances, showing not only the results but also the creative process behind them. It highlights the artists' gestures, interests, and the challenges they encountered, offering a deeper insight into the products they create. \n","performers":"Julien Renault, Angel Barrero, Unfold, Frederik Rombach, Gaston Golstein, \u00c9tienne Guillaume, Flora Miranda, Kenny Damian, Frederik Delbart, John Dierickx, Alice Pilastre & Julien Moermans","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/duos-resonances","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003836"},"it":{"name":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/duos-resonances","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003836"},"cn":{"name":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/duos-resonances","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003836"},"fr":{"name":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances","shortdescr":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances est une exposition qui vise \u00e0 renforcer le dialogue entre l'artisanat et le design. ","longdescr":"L'exposition Duos en R\u00e9sonances pr\u00e9sente le travail de six designers et de six artisan\u00b7e\u00b7s, allant de la fabrication de gaufres en verre moul\u00e9 \u00e0 des broderies inspir\u00e9es de motifs g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9s par ordinateur.\n\nDuos en R\u00e9sonances est un projet de Wallonie Design cr\u00e9\u00e9 en 2017 et soutenu par le Fonds Sofina&Bo\u00ebl pour l'Education et le Talent depuis 2020. Pendant six mois, six duos compos\u00e9s d\u2019artisan\u00b7e\u00b7s et de designers collaborent sur le d\u00e9veloppement d\u2019un projet ou d\u2019une id\u00e9e commune. Le\u00b7la designer travaille directement avec un\u00b7e expert\u00b7e en mat\u00e9riaux et en techniques, tandis que l'artisan\u00b7e d\u00e9couvre une approche ou une m\u00e9thode de travail diff\u00e9rente, qui l'incite \u00e0 sortir de sa pratique professionnelle quotidienne. Du 6 d\u00e9cembre au 22 f\u00e9vrier, les r\u00e9sultats de ces six collaborations seront expos\u00e9s au grand public au MAD Brussels.\n\nUNE EXPOSITION AVEC\n\u2014 Julien Renault (designer produit) & Angel Barrero (staffeur et stucateur)\n\u2014 Unfold (designers\/chercheurs) & Frederik Rombach (souffleur de verre)\n\u2014 Gaston Golstein (designer industriel au sein de Duplex Studio) & \u00c9tienne Guillaume (sp\u00e9cialiste de la terre crue chez Elementerre)\n\u2014 Flora Miranda (cr\u00e9atrice de mode) & Kenny Damian (brodeuse)\n\u2014 Frederik Delbart (designer industriel) & John Dierickx (sp\u00e9cialiste du vitrail chez Studio Artglas)\n\u2014 Alice Pilastre (designer textile) & Julien Moermans (tufteur)\n\nLES SIX DUOS\n\u00c0 la suite d'un appel \u00e0 candidatures, six duos ont \u00e9t\u00e9 constitu\u00e9s. Gaufres de verre, lampe en vitrail ou encore un tabouret singulier sont les cr\u00e9ations qui r\u00e9sultent de ces associations. Le duo Angel Barrero et Julien Renault a souhait\u00e9 projeter la technique du stuc de marbre de l\u2019architecture vers l\u2019objet fonctionnel. Ils proposent un rendu brut de la mati\u00e8re en totale opposition \u00e0 la finition soign\u00e9e de cette technique du XVIe si\u00e8cle. La collaboration entre Kenny Damian et Flora Miranda met en \u00e9vidence une forme de dualit\u00e9 interconnect\u00e9e entre motif r\u00e9alis\u00e9 par ordinateur et broderie \u00e0 la main. Etienne Guillaume et Duplex Studio (Gaston Golstein) ont \u00e0 leur tour transpos\u00e9 la technique du pis\u00e9 du monde de la construction vers celui de l\u2019objet. Ils questionnent ainsi le cycle de vie d\u2019une pi\u00e8ce en terre crue.\n\nLa collaboration entre Frederik Rombach et Unfold (Claire Warnier and Dries Verbruggen) repose sur la symbolique de la gaufre belge. En moulant des gaufres en verre, ils montrent d\u2019une fa\u00e7on ludique qu\u2019elles s'emboitent et deviennent des connecteurs avec d'autres mat\u00e9riaux. Tandis que le duo Julien Moermans et Alice Pilastre questionnent la vie du tapis et de sa mati\u00e8re. En omettant les finitions et en effilochant celui-ci, sa structure est susceptible d\u2019\u00e9voluer au fil de son usage jusqu\u2019\u00e0 possiblement dispara\u00eetre. John Dierickx et Frederik Delbart d\u00e9construisent les traits bidimensionnels du vitrail qui nous sont familiers et les r\u00e9imaginent dans des objets tridimensionnels. Ils d\u00e9couvrent dans cette transposition de nouvelles perspectives \u00e9tonnantes.\n\nSC\u00c9NOGRAPHIE\nAvec le soutien de la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles, la sc\u00e9nographie de l'expo a \u00e9t\u00e9 confi\u00e9e au studio de design bruxellois Studio Plastique. Elle refl\u00e8te la nature exp\u00e9rimentale de Duos en R\u00e9sonances, mettant en valeur non seulement les r\u00e9sultats, mais aussi le processus cr\u00e9atif qui les a engendr\u00e9s. La sc\u00e9nographie met en lumi\u00e8re les gestes des artistes, leurs int\u00e9r\u00eats et les d\u00e9fis qu'ils ont rencontr\u00e9s, offrant ainsi un aper\u00e7u approfondi des produits qu'ils cr\u00e9ent.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/duos-resonances","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003836"},"sp":{"name":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/duos-resonances","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003836"},"nl":{"name":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances","shortdescr":"Duos en R\u00e9sonances is een tentoonstelling die de dialoog tussen ambacht en design wil versterken.","longdescr":"Van gegoten glazen wafels tot borduurwerk op basis van een computergegenereerd patroon. De tentoonstelling Duos en R\u00e9sonances toont het werk van 6 designers en 6 ambachtslieden.\n\nDuos en R\u00e9sonances is een project van Wallonie Design dat in 2017 tot stand kwam en sinds 2020 wordt  gesteund door het Sofina&Bo\u00ebl Fonds voor Opleiding en Talent. Gedurende zes maanden werken zes duo's van ambachtelijke kunstenaars en designers aan de uitwerking van een gezamenlijk project of idee. De designer krijgt zo de kans rechtstreeks samen te werken met een expert in materialen en technieken. De ambachtsman of vrouw ontdekt op zijn of haar beurt een andere benadering of werkwijze die hem of haar uitdaagt om buiten de dagelijkse beroepspraktijk te treden. Van 6 december tot 22 februari worden bij MAD Brussels de resultaten van de zes samenwerkingen tentoongesteld aan het grote publiek.\n\nEEN TENTOONSTELLING MET\n\u2014 Julien Renault (productontwerper) & Angel Barrero (stukadoor)\n\u2014 Unfold (Claire Warnier & Dries Verbruggen, ontwerpers\/onderzoekers) & Frederik Rombach (glasblazer)\n\u2014 Gaston Golstein (industrieel ontwerper bij Duplex Studio) & \u00c9tienne Guillaume (specialist in ruwe aarde bij Elementerre)\n\u2014 Flora Miranda (modeontwerpster) & Kenny Damian (borduurster)\n\u2014 Frederik Delbart (industrieel ontwerper) & John Dierickx (Studio Artglas, specialist in glas-in-lood)\n\u2014 Alice Pilastre (textiel ontwerper) & Julien Moermans (tufter)\n \nDE ZES DUO'S\nNa een oproep tot kandidaturen, werden zes duo's samengesteld die elk aan een eigen, uniek project zouden beginnen. Van glazen wafels tot een nieuw verlichtingselement en een experimentele kruk. Het duo Angel Barrero en Julien Renault wilde de techniek van het marmeren stucwerk toepassen op een vrije vorm. Door af te wijken van de door de techniek opgelegde gewoonten en het materiaal op een ruwere en radicalere manier te benaderen, bieden ze een nieuwe blik op een zorgvuldige en nauwgezette praktijk die teruggaat tot de 16e eeuw. Kenny Damian en Flora Miranda wilden met hun samenwerking een vorm van onderling verbonden dualiteit tussen computergegenereerde patronen en borduurwerk in de kijker zetten. Etienne Guillaume en Duplex Studio (Gaston Golstein) vertaalden op hun beurt de pis\u00e9 techniek uit de bouw naar de productie van een object. Tijdens de loop van het project, stelden ze de levenscyclus en het einde van de gebruiksduur van een afgewerkt stuk ruwe aarde in vraag.\n\nHet resultaat van de samenwerking van Frederik Rombach en Unfold (Claire Warnier en Dries Verbruggen) is ge\u00efnspireerd op de symbolische Belgische wafel. Ze goten wafels van glas en lieten zo op een speelse manier zien hoe ze in elkaar passen en verbindingsstukken kunnen worden tussen verschillende materialen. Verder onderzocht het duo Julien Moermans en Alice Pilastre de levensduur van tapijten en hun materialen. Door het weglaten van bepaalde afwerkingen en het uitrafelen van het tapijt, zal de structuur van het tapijt evolueren door het gebruik en uiteindelijk verdwijnen. Tenslotte herdachten John Dierickx en Frederik Delbart van de vertrouwde tweedimensionale kenmerken van glas in lood en gaven het een nieuwe vorm als driedimensionale objecten. Hierbij ontdekken ze nieuwe perspectieven en verrassende invalshoeken.\n\nSCENOGRAFIE\nMet de steun van de F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles, werd de scenografie van de expo toevertrouwd aan de Brusselse designstudio Studio Plastique. Deze vormgeving weerspiegelt de experimentele aard van Duos en R\u00e9sonances en toont niet alleen de resultaten, maar ook het creatieve proces erachter. Het belicht de gebaren, interesses en uitdagingen van de kunstenaars en biedt een dieper inzicht in de producten die ze cre\u00ebren. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/mad.brussels\/en\/agenda\/duos-resonances","email":"contact@mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003836"}},"place":{"id":250516,"translations":{"de":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12629,"location":{"lat":50.851148,"lon":4.3441836},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-03-04T10:32:39+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:34:31+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":250516,"translations":{"de":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels ist eine Br\u00fcsseler Mode- und Designplattform, die sich der F\u00f6rderung, Unterst\u00fctzung und Begleitung der Br\u00fcsseler Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designern verschrieben hat, um sowohl landesweit als auch international ihre Reichweite zu erh\u00f6hen.\r\n\r\nDie Er\u00f6ffnung des neuen, komplett in Wei\u00df gehaltenen Geb\u00e4udes hat dem MAD Brussels noch einmal frischen Wind in den Segeln beschert. Hier befinden sich nicht nur Ressourcen f\u00fcr Vertreter der Kreativindustrie und damit zusammenh\u00e4ngenden Metiers, sondern auch vielf\u00e4ltig nutzbare Arbeitspl\u00e4tze und Orte der Begegnung. Modesch\u00f6pfer und Designer haben hier eine Anlaufstelle, gleichzeitig finden in den R\u00e4umen Ateliers, Workshops, Seminare, Ausstellungen, Modeschauen, Kunst-Performances statt\u2026\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"MAD Brussels is a Brussels\u2019 platform for gathering expertise from the city\u2019s Fashion and Design sectors. It aims to help with the promotion and development of Brussels stylists and designers and improve their exposure nationally and abroad.\r\n\r\nThe opening in April 2017 of their brand new, sparkling white headquarters marked something of a renaissance for the non-profit organisation, which can now multiply and combine its campaigns. It houses a ressource centre for professionals of the creative industries and related sectors, along with adaptable workspaces, meeting spaces, workshops, seminar rooms and a large space dedicated to public activities where multiple events are organised every year: exhibitions, fashion shows, artistic performances\u2026\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels est la plateforme bruxelloise d\u2019expertise dans les secteurs de la Mode et du Design.   Elle s\u2019emploie \u00e0 renforcer la promotion, \u00e0 accompagner le d\u00e9veloppement des stylistes et designers bruxellois et \u00e0 accro\u00eetre leur rayonnement (inter )national.  \r\n\r\nL\u2019ouverture en avril 2017 du nouveau b\u00e2timent enti\u00e8rement blanc a marqu\u00e9 une renaissance pour l\u2019asbl, qui dans ce lieu unique multiplie et combine ses actions. Il h\u00e9berge le centre de ressources pour les professionnels des industries cr\u00e9atives aux fili\u00e8res de m\u00e9tiers d\u00e9riv\u00e9es, des espaces de travail polyvalents, lieux de rencontres, d\u2019accueil de cr\u00e9ateurs, d\u2019ateliers, de s\u00e9minaires, ainsi qu\u2019un grand espace d\u00e9di\u00e9 aux activit\u00e9s publiques o\u00f9 sont organis\u00e9es chaque ann\u00e9e de multiples \u00e9v\u00e8nements: expositions, d\u00e9fil\u00e9s, performances artistiques,\u2026\r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place du Nouveau March\u00e9 aux Grains, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"MAD Brussels es una plataforma de Bruselas que reune expertos del los sectores de la moda y el dise\u00f1o. Tiene como objetivo ayudar en la promoci\u00f3n y el desarrollo de los dise\u00f1adores y estilistas de Bruselas y mejorar su imagen nacional e internacional.\r\nLa apertura de su novedosa y chispeante sede en abril de 2017 marc\u00f3 algo as\u00ed como el renacimiento para la organizaci\u00f3n sin \u00e1nimo de lucro, que ahora puede multiplicar y combinar sus campa\u00f1as. Posee un centro de recursos para profesionales de industrias culturales y sectores relacionados, junto con espacios de trabajo adaptados, lugares de reuni\u00f3n, talleres, seminarios y un gran espacio dedicado a actividades p\u00fablicas donde se organizan diversos eventos cada a\u00f1o: exhibiciones, desfiles de moda, representaciones art\u00edsticas\u2026\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"MAD Brussels","address_street_name":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@mad.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.mad.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 880 85 62","phone_booking":"+32 2 880 85 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Nieuwe Graanmarkt, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"MAD Brussels is het Brussels kennisplatform voor de mode- en designsectoren.  Het zet zich in voor de promotie en begeleiding van Brusselse stylisten en ontwerpers en de vergroting van hun (inter)nationale uitstraling. \r\n\r\nDe opening van hun nieuwe, volledig witte gebouw in april 2017 betekende een belangrijke impuls voor de vzw die op die unieke plek zijn verschillende doelstellingen kan uitbreiden en combineren. Het gebouw herbergt het onderzoekscentrum voor professionals uit de creatieve sectoren en aanverwante beroepsgroepen, multifunctionele werkruimtes, ontmoetingsplekken, ontvangstruimtes voor ontwerpers, workshops en seminaries en daarbij ook nog een grote ruimte waarin elk jaar verschillende activiteiten voor het grote publiek plaatsvinden, zoals tentoonstellingen, modeshows of artistieke performances.  \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":12629,"location":{"lat":50.851148,"lon":4.3441836},"last_updated_at":"2024-03-04T10:32:39+01:00","published_at":"20