voquent des influences et des nouveaut\u00e9s. Leurs chemins festoient les archipels d\u2019Est en Ouest, des Cara\u00efbes aux champs de coton du grand Nord, des paysanneries battues aux airs du rythme des saisons, des gammes mandingues aux blues du Sahel. Petit fils du Chef des Griots du Burkina Faso Baba Abdoulaye Kienou, Sina est \u00e9galement, aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de Soledad, sa comparse et compagne, l\u2019ambassadeur d\u2019un langage universel dont les origines puisent leur h\u00e9ritage dans le Mand\u00e9. \n\nInfos et r\u00e9servations au 02 420 37 27 \u2013 info@lavillaculture.be\n\nP.A.F. : 5 euros","performers":"Avec Soledad Kalza et Sina Kienou","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lavillaculture.be\/rdv-cosmics-le-duo-soledad-kalza-et-sina-kienou\/","email":"info@lavillaculture.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 420 37 27","phone_booking":"+32 2 420 37 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003982"},"sp":{"name":"Soledad Kalza et Sina Kienou (Duo)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lavillaculture.be\/rdv-cosmics-le-duo-soledad-kalza-et-sina-kienou\/","email":"info@lavillaculture.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 420 37 27","phone_booking":"+32 2 420 37 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003982"},"nl":{"name":"Soledad Kalza et Sina Kienou (Duo)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lavillaculture.be\/rdv-cosmics-le-duo-soledad-kalza-et-sina-kienou\/","email":"info@lavillaculture.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 420 37 27","phone_booking":"+32 2 420 37 27","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700003982"}},"place":{"id":220064,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Ganshoren La Villa","address_street_name":"Place Guido Gezelle","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lavillaculture.be","we