:"Musical show about animals in opera for all the family.","longdescr":"Animopera is a musical show from the \u2018First Steps at the Opera\u2019 project, designed as an introduction to opera and operetta especially for children. It's a plunge into the bestiary of the operatic world: animal arias written by Rossini, Mozart, Bazin, Messager and Offenbach and sung by a soprano and a baritone.\nWhen the animals take to the opera stage, they meow, bark and delight the whole family!\nCome and enjoy an extraordinary cultural experience with Animop\u00e9ra, a show in which the arias of cats and dogs provide a joyful introduction to the world of opera.\nwww.soprane.be\/animopera","performers":"Creation, singing (soprano), production: Olga Dubois\nCreation, vocals (baritone), choreography: Jean-Luc Yerl\u00e8s\nPianists: Anait Karpova, Ines Defuster\nStage direction: Isabelle Dumont\nLyric arts consultant: Alexandre Maslennikov-Swistounoff\nLighting design: Jean-Jacques Deneumoustier","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/soprane.be\/recommends\/animopera-agenda","email":"info@soprane.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 66 05 18","phone_booking":"+32 471 66 05 18","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002257"},"it":{"name":"Animop\u00e9ra","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/soprane.be\/recommends\/animopera-agenda","email":"info@soprane.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 66 05 18","phone_booking":"+32 471 66 05 18","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002257"},"cn":{"name":"Animop\u00e9ra","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/soprane.be\/recommends\/animopera-agenda","email":"info@soprane.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 66 05 18","phone_booking":"+32 471 66 05 18","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002257"},"fr":{"name":"Animop\u00e9ra","shortdescr":"Spectacle musical sur les animaux dans l\u2019op\u00e9ra pour toute la famille.","longdescr":"Animopera est un spectacle musical du projet \u00ab Premiers pas \u00e0 l\u2019Op\u00e9ra \u00bb qui se veut \u00eatre une introduction \u00e0 l\u2019op\u00e9ra et \u00e0 l\u2019op\u00e9rette sp\u00e9cialement destin\u00e9e aux enfants. Une plong\u00e9e dans le bestiaire du monde de l\u2019op\u00e9ra : des arias des animaux \u00e9crits par Rossini, Mozart, Bazin, Messager, Offenbach et chant\u00e9s par une soprane et un baryton.\nQuand les animaux montent sur la sc\u00e8ne de l\u2019op\u00e9ra, \u00e7a miaule, \u00e7a aboie et \u00e7a enchante toute la famille !\nVenez vivre une exp\u00e9rience culturelle hors du commun avec Animop\u00e9ra, un spectacle o\u00f9 les arias des chats et des chiens offrent une entr\u00e9e joyeuse dans le monde de l\u2019op\u00e9ra.\nwww.soprane.be\/animopera","performers":"Cr\u00e9ation, chant (soprano), production : Olga Dubois\nCr\u00e9ation, chant (baryton), chor\u00e9graphie : Jean-Luc Yerl\u00e8s\nPianiste : Anait Karpova, Ines Defuster\nMise en sc\u00e8ne : Isabelle Dumont\nConseiller art lyrique : Alexandre Maslennikov-Swistounoff\nCr\u00e9ation lumi\u00e8re : Jean-Jacques Deneumoustier","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/soprane.be\/recommends\/animopera-agenda","email":"info@soprane.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 66 05 18","phone_booking":"+32 471 66 05 18","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002257"},"sp":{"name":"Animop\u00e9ra","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/soprane.be\/recommends\/animopera-agenda","email":"info@soprane.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 66 05 18","phone_booking":"+32 471 66 05 18","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002257"},"nl":{"name":"Animop\u00e9ra","shortdescr":"Muzikale show over dieren in de opera voor het hele gezin.","longdescr":"Animopera is een muzikale voorstelling uit het project \u201cEerste stappen in de opera\u201d, bedoeld als introductie tot opera en operette speciaal voor kinderen. Het is een duik in het bestiarium van de operawereld: dierenaria's geschreven door Rossini, Mozart, Bazin, Messager en Offenbach en gezongen door een sopraan en een bariton.\nWanneer de dieren het operapodium betreden, miauwen en blaffen ze en brengen ze het hele gezin in vervoering!\nKom genieten van een buitengewone culturele ervaring met Animop\u00e9ra, een show waarin de aria's van katten en honden een vrolijke introductie geven tot de wereld van de opera.\nwww.soprane.be\/animopera","performers":"Creation, zang (sopraan), productie: Olga Dubois\nCreatie, zang (bariton), choreografie: Jean-Luc Yerl\u00e8s\nPianisten: Anait Karpova, Ines Defuster\nRegie: Isabelle Dumont\nAdviseur tekstkunsten: Alexandre Maslennikov-Swistounoff\nLichtontwerp: Jean-Jacques Deneumoustier","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/soprane.be\/recommends\/animopera-agenda","email":"info@soprane.be","phone_contact":"+32 471 66 05 18","phone_booking":"+32 471 66 05 18","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700002257"}},"place":{"id":204305,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Bruegel","address_street_name":"Rue des Renards","address_street_number":"1 F","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccbruegel.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 2 503 42 68","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Renards, 1 F","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Centre Culturel Bruegel","address_street_name":"Rue des Renards","address_street_number":"1 F","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@ccbruegel.be","website":"http:\/\/www.ccbruegel.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 503 42 68","phone_booking":"+32 