5628"},"en":{"name":"TXT et hommage \u00e0 Jean-Pierre Verheggen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/11\/txt-et-hommage-a-jean-pierre-verheggen","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005628"},"it":{"name":"TXT et hommage \u00e0 Jean-Pierre Verheggen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/11\/txt-et-hommage-a-jean-pierre-verheggen","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005628"},"cn":{"name":"TXT et hommage \u00e0 Jean-Pierre Verheggen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/11\/txt-et-hommage-a-jean-pierre-verheggen","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005628"},"fr":{"name":"TXT et hommage \u00e0 Jean-Pierre Verheggen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Ce midi po\u00e9sie rend hommage au grand po\u00e8te belge d\u2019expression fran\u00e7aise, Jean-Pierre Verheggen, \u00e0 travers une pr\u00e9sentation de la revue TXT, publi\u00e9e aux \u00e9ditions Lurlure, dans le cadre d\u2019un sp\u00e9cial Verheggen. Il proposera une s\u00e9lection de lectures individuelles et collectives de textes de Jean-Pierre Verheggen, ainsi que d\u2019auteurs et autrices pr\u00e9sents, et se conclura par un temps d\u2019\u00e9change avec le public.\n\nPour cet \u00e9v\u00e9nement, nous aurons le plaisir d\u2019accueillir Lambert Castellani, Mardi Forestier, Bruno Fern et Jacques Bonnaff\u00e9, qui nous feront l\u2019honneur d\u2019une lecture \u00e0 quatre voix d\u2019un texte du po\u00e8te.\n\nJean-Pierre Verheggen a \u00e9t\u00e9 \u00e9troitement associ\u00e9 \u00e0 la revue TXT depuis son premier num\u00e9ro en 1969 jusqu\u2019au n\u00b035, publi\u00e9 cinquante-trois ans plus tard. Ce num\u00e9ro inclut des textes in\u00e9dits du po\u00e8te et les adieux de ses anciens compagnons de route : Philippe Boutibonnes, \u00c9ric Cl\u00e9mens, Alain Frontier, Pierre Le Pillou\u00ebr et Christian Prigent.\n\nD\u2019autres auteurs contemporains, tels que Jean-Pierre Bobillot, Lambert Castellani, Cuhel, Bruno Fern, Typhaine Garnier et Charles Pennequin, ainsi que les universitaires B\u00e9n\u00e9dicte Gorrillot, Olivier Penot-Lacassagne et Anne-Christine Roy\u00e8re, participent \u00e9galement \u00e0 ce num\u00e9ro, sans oublier Jacques Bonnaff\u00e9, l\u2019interpr\u00e8te truculent de ses textes sur sc\u00e8ne.\n\nDans la tradition verhegg\u00e9nienne et l\u2019esprit de la revue TXT, cet hommage m\u00ealera s\u00e9rieux et d\u00e9rision, en c\u00e9l\u00e9brant les grandes irr\u00e9gularit\u00e9s du langage. Comme l\u2019illustre cette citation de Jean-Pierre Verheggen tir\u00e9e d\u2019une interview en 2009 : \"L\u2019autre jour, j\u2019\u00e9tais \u00e0 Charleville-M\u00e9zi\u00e8res, sur la tombe de Rimbaud, et je me disais : nous sommes devant un \u00ab troumlala \u00bb. \u00ab Troumlala \u00bb, ce n\u2019est pas un mot qui existe, qui va comprendre \u00e7a ?\"","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/11\/txt-et-hommage-a-jean-pierre-verheggen","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005628"},"sp":{"name":"TXT et hommage \u00e0 Jean-Pierre Verheggen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/11\/txt-et-hommage-a-jean-pierre-verheggen","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005628"},"nl":{"name":"TXT et hommage \u00e0 Jean-Pierre Verheggen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2025\/02\/11\/txt-et-hommage-a-jean-pierre-verheggen","email":"simeon.martinel@midisdelapoesie.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005628"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmasters Museum, Modern Museum, Meunier Museum, Wiertz Museum, Magritte Museum and the Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Reale delle Belle Arti del Belgio","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/