,"website":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/bright-festival","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005767"},"en":{"name":"Bright Brussels 2025 Rotary Guinguette","shortdescr":"Rotary Club Brussels Cantersteen will serve refreshments during Bright Brussels Thursday-Sunday, 13-16 Feb. 2025 from 6:30 to 11 pm across from the Cathedral of St. Michael and St. Gudula to raise money for Serve the City Brussels. All proceeds will go to this non-profit charity. Bright Brussels displays more than 20 outdoor light installations by artists from all over the world.\n\n","longdescr":"The annual Bright Brussels light show in February will be a bit brighter this year with a local Rotary club serving up drinks for the first time as a fundraiser for a Brussels-based charity. The magical spectacle by Visit Brussels displays more than 20 outdoor light installations by artists from all over the world. \n\nOn Thursday to Sunday, 13-16 Feb. 2025 from 6:30 to 11 pm, a refreshment chalet will be hosted by Rotary Club Brussels Cantersteen in the park across from the Cathedral of Saint Michael and Saint Gudula. It will sell drinks to fundraise for Serve the City Brussels, which helps the elderly, homeless, children in need, people with disabilities, victims of abuse, and asylum seekers and refugees. All proceeds will go to this non-profit charity.","performers":"Refreshment chalet operated by Rotary Club Brussels Cantersteen to support Serve the City Brussels","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/bright-festival","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005767"},"it":{"name":"Bright Brussels 2025 Rotary Guinguette","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/bright-festival","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005767"},"cn":{"name":"Bright Brussels 2025 Rotary Guinguette","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/bright-festival","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005767"},"fr":{"name":"Bright Brussels 2025 Rotary Guinguette","shortdescr":"Le Rotary Club Brussels Cantersteen servira des rafra\u00eechissements pendant Bright Brussels du jeudi au dimanche, du 13 au 16 f\u00e9vrier 2025, de 18h30 \u00e0 23h, en face de la cath\u00e9drale Saint-Michel et Sainte-Gudule, afin de r\u00e9colter des fonds pour Serve the City Brussels. Bright Brussels pr\u00e9sente plus de 20 installations lumineuses en plein air r\u00e9alis\u00e9es par des artistes du monde entier.","longdescr":"Le spectacle annuel de lumi\u00e8res Bright Brussels, qui a lieu en f\u00e9vrier, sera un peu plus lumineux cette \nann\u00e9e : pour la premi\u00e8re fois, un club Rotary local servira des boissons au profit d'une association caritative bruxelloise. Le spectacle magique organis\u00e9 par Visit Brussels pr\u00e9sente plus de 20 installations lumineuses en plein air r\u00e9alis\u00e9es par des artistes du monde entier. \n\nDu jeudi au dimanche, du 13 au 16 f\u00e9vrier 2025, de 18h30 \u00e0 23h, une guinguette sera install\u00e9 par le Rotary Club Brussels Cantersteen dans le parc situ\u00e9 en face de la cath\u00e9drale Saint-Michel et Sainte-Gudule. Il vendra des boissons au profit de Serve the City Brussels, qui vient en aide aux personnes \u00e2g\u00e9es, aux sans-abri, aux enfants dans le besoin, aux personnes handicap\u00e9es, aux victimes d'abus, aux demandeurs d'asile et aux r\u00e9fugi\u00e9s. Tous les b\u00e9n\u00e9fices seront revers\u00e9s \u00e0 cette association caritative sans but lucratif.","performers":"Guinguette offerte par le Rotary Club Brussels Cantersteen au profit de Serve the City Brussels","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/bright-festival","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005767"},"sp":{"name":"Bright Brussels 2025 Rotary Guinguette","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/bright-festival","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005767"},"nl":{"name":"Bright Brussels 2025 Rotary Guinguette","shortdescr":"Rotary Club Brussels Cantersteen zal verfrissingen serveren tijdens Bright Brussels donderdag-zondag, 13-16 februari 2025 van 18u30 tot 23u tegenover de Sint-Michiels- en Sint-Goedelekathedraal om geld in te zamelen voor Serve the City Brussels. Bright Brussels toont meer dan 20 lichtinstallaties in de open lucht van kunstenaars van over de hele wereld.","longdescr":"De jaarlijkse Bright Brussels lichtshow in februari zal dit jaar een beetje feller zijn met een lokale Rotary club die voor de eerste keer drankjes serveert als fondsenwerving voor een Brussels goed doel. Het magische spektakel van Visit Brussels toont 20+ lichtinstallaties in de open lucht van kunstenaars van over de hele wereld. \n\nOp donderdag tot en met zondag, 13-16 februari 2025 van 18.30 tot 23.00 uur, zal Rotary Club Brussels Cantersteen in het park tegenover de Sint-Michiels- en Sint-Goedelekathedraal een verfrissingschalet plaatsen. Er worden drankjes verkocht om geld in te zamelen voor Serve the City Brussels, dat bejaarden, daklozen, kinderen in nood, mensen met een handicap, slachtoffers van misbruik en asielzoekers en vluchtelingen helpt. Alle opbrengsten gaan naar deze liefdadigheidsinstelling zonder winstoogmerk.","performers":"Drinkguinguette uitgebaat door Rotary Club Brussels Cantersteen ter ondersteuning van Serve the City Brussels","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/bright-festival","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005767"}},"place":{"id":50001688,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Brussels Cathedral","address_street_name":"Rue du Bois Sauvage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Bois Sauvage","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Brussels Cathedral","address_street_name":"Rue du Bois Sauvage","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Bois Sauvage","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Brussels Cathedral","address_street_name":"Wildewoudstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.cathedralisbruxellensis.be\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Wildewoudstraat","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Brussels Cathedral","address_street_name":"Rue du Bois Sauvage","address_street_number":null,"