"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005721"},"fr":{"name":"Afterwork by Les Garces - Karaoke Extravaganza","shortdescr":"Un Afterwork unique en son genre, m\u00ealant karaok\u00e9, performances drag et ambiance festive. Rejoignez Les Garces tous les jeudis pour une soir\u00e9e pleine d\u2019\u00e9nergie et de surprises.","longdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez un Afterwork pas comme les autres avec Les Garces lors de leur Karaoke Extravaganza. Chaque jeudi, laissez-vous emporter par une ambiance chaleureuse et d\u00e9jant\u00e9e, m\u00ealant karaok\u00e9 interactif, performances drag inoubliables, et une dose de bonne humeur pour bien terminer votre journ\u00e9e.\n\nHoraires :\nOuverture d\u00e8s portes : 17h30\nKaraok\u00e9 d\u00e8s 18h30\nHappy Hour 17:30 - 19:30\n\nL'entr\u00e9e est gratuite!\n\nQue vous soyez chanteur amateur ou simple spectateur, une chose est s\u00fbre : vos jeudis ne seront plus jamais les m\u00eames.","performers":"Natalia, Bianca l'Or, Miss Pam Ella","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lesgarces.com","email":"gaetan@lesgarces.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005721"},"sp":{"name":"Afterwork by Les Garces - Karaoke Extravaganza","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lesgarces.com","email":"gaetan@lesgarces.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005721"},"nl":{"name":"Afterwork by Les Garces - Karaoke Extravaganza","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.lesgarces.com","email":"gaetan@lesgarces.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005721"}},"place":{"id":50002427,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Petite rue au Beurre","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Petite rue au Beurre, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Petite rue au Beurre","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Petite rue au Beurre, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Korte Boterstraat","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Korte Boterstraat, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"After travelling the world and the sevens seas, Famous Drag singer \u00ab LaDiva Live \u00bb settles down right in the centre of Brussels by opening a new venue called \u00ab Potiche \u00ab with Lara Fullcamp queen of burlesque.\nYou can expect Cabaret every Friday and Saturday with drag shows and live performances from 8 pm.\nKaraoke and after work parties every Thursdays from 7 pm\nTea dance with special guests and themes every Sunday from 5:30 pm.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Petite rue au Beurre","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Petite rue au Beurre, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Petite rue au Beurre","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Petite rue au Beurre, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_name":"Petite rue au Beurre","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@potiche.brussels","website":"https:\/\/potiche.brussels\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Petite rue au Beurre, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"LaDiva Live, notre chanteuse Drag s\u2019installe \u00e0 Bruxelles apr\u00e8s avoir voyag\u00e9 autour du globe . \nAvec Lara Fullcamp, l\u2019extravagante queen burlesque, elle vous invite chez \u00ab Potiche \u00ab au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles et \u00e0 2 pas de la Grand place.\nAu programme: shows drag, burlesque et performances live tous les vendredis et samedis.\nKaraoke et after works les jeudis \u00e0 partir de 18h\nTea dances les Dimanches \u00e0 partir de 17h30 avec diff\u00e9rentes themes et artiste invit\u00e9s.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Potiche Cabaret - Bar","address_street_