,"sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"de":["Klassisch"],"pt":[null],"en":["Classical"],"it":["Classica"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Classique"],"sp":["Cl\u00e1sica"],"nl":["Klassiek"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"piano recital with commentary \/ valentine's day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.valentin25.be","email":"info@valentin25.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013269"},"pt":{"name":"piano recital with commentary \/ valentine's day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.valentin25.be","email":"info@valentin25.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013269"},"en":{"name":"piano recital with commentary \/ valentine's day","shortdescr":"The piano in love with poets. \nLiszt, Beethoven, Debussy, Chopin, Schumann,... ","longdescr":"\"J'ai mis mon c\u0153ur entre tes mains\" (Louis Aragon)\nThe poets' piano in love. \nLove, one of the most frequently set to music! \u2028This Valentine's Day, rediscover on the piano the unforgettable masterpieces inspired by poetic love: wonderful fields of dreams where French poetry (Ronsard, Hugo, Verlaine, Eluard, Aragon...) meets European musical romanticism. \nOlivier will play some famous pieces by great composers inspired by Love: Liszt, Beethoven, Debussy, Chopin, Schumann... \u2028(R\u00eave d'amour, Pour Elise, Clair de lune, Rigoletto, etc.), presented to the public in the \"commented recital\" format that has made him such a success and taken him all over the world (Europe, Asia, Canada, South America, Russia, Middle East).                                                                                                       ","performers":"olivier de spiegeleir, piano and commentary","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.valentin25.be","email":"info@valentin25.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013269"},"it":{"name":"piano recital with commentary \/ valentine's day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.valentin25.be","email":"info@valentin25.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013269"},"cn":{"name":"piano recital with commentary \/ valentine's day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.valentin25.be","email":"info@valentin25.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013269"},"fr":{"name":"r\u00e9cital de piano comment\u00e9 \/ saint-valentin","shortdescr":"Le piano amoureux des po\u00e8tes.\nLiszt, Beethoven, Debussy, Chopin, Schumann,... ","longdescr":"\u00ab J'ai mis mon c\u0153ur entre tes mains\u00a0\u00bb (Louis Aragon)\nLe piano amoureux des po\u00e8tes. \nL\u2019Amour, un des sentiments les plus souvent mis en musique\u00a0! \u2028Ce sera l\u2019occasion, pour la Saint-Valentin, de red\u00e9couvrir au piano les chefs-d\u2019\u0153uvre inoubliables inspir\u00e9s par l\u2019Amour po\u00e9tique\u00a0: merveilleux champs de r\u00eaves o\u00f9 la po\u00e9sie fran\u00e7aise (Ronsard, Hugo, Verlaine, Eluard, Aragon...) \u2028rencontre le romantisme musical europ\u00e9en. \nOlivier jouera quelques pi\u00e8ces c\u00e9l\u00e8bres\u00a0de grands compositeurs inspir\u00e9s par l\u2019Amour : Liszt, Beethoven, Debussy, Chopin, Schumann,... \u2028(R\u00eave d'amour, Pour Elise, Clair de lune, Rigoletto, \u2026), \u2028pr\u00e9sent\u00e9es au public selon la formule \u00ab r\u00e9cital comment\u00e9 \u00bb, \u2028qui fait son succ\u00e8s et l\u2019a men\u00e9 dans le monde entier \u2028(Europe, Asie, Canada, Am\u00e9rique du Sud, Russie, Moyen Orient). \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0","performers":"olivier de spiegeleir, piano et commentaires","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.valentin25.be","email":"info@valentin25.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013269"},"sp":{"name":"piano recital with commentary \/ valentine's day","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.valentin25.be","email":"info@valentin25.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013269"},"nl":{"name":"pianorecital met commentaar \/ valentijnsdag","shortdescr":"De piano verliefd op dichters. \nLiszt, Beethoven, Debussy, Chopin, Schumann,... ","longdescr":"\"Ik leg mijn hart in jouw handen\" (Louis Aragon)\nDe verliefde piano van de dichters. \nLiefde, een van de gevoelens die het vaakst op muziek wordt gezet! \u2028Herontdek op deze Valentijnsdag op de piano de onvergetelijke meesterwerken ge\u00efnspireerd door de po\u00ebtische liefde: prachtige droomvelden waar de Franse po\u00ebzie (Ronsard, Hugo, Verlaine, Eluard, Aragon...) en de Europese muzikale romantiek elkaar ontmoeten. \nOlivier zal een aantal beroemde stukken spelen van grote componisten die ge\u00efnspireerd zijn door de liefde: Liszt, Beethoven, Debussy, Chopin, Schumann,... \u2028(R\u00eave d'amour, Pour Elise, Clair de lune, Rigoletto, enz.), gepresenteerd aan het publiek in het formaat \"recital met commentaar\" dat hem zo'n succes heeft gemaakt en hem over de hele wereld heeft gebracht (Europa, Azi\u00eb, Canada, Zuid-Amerika, Rusland, Midden-Oosten).                                                                                                       ","performers":"olivier de spiegeleir, piano en commentaar","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.valentin25.be","email":"info@valentin25.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013269"}},"place":{"id":243127,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Sint-Marcuskerk","address_street_name":"Avenue De Fr\u00e9","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue De Fr\u00e9, 76","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Sint-Marcuskerk","address_street_name":"Avenue De Fr\u00e9","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Avenue De Fr\u00e9, 76","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Eglise Saint-Marc","address_street_name":"De Fr\u00e9laan","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"De Fr\u00e9laan, 76","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url"