le with GRABUGE\nPlongez dans une exp\u00e9rience gastronomique unique lors de notre \u00e9v\u00e9nement CHEF'S TABLE, en collaboration avec Grabuge, un restaurant bruxellois renomm\u00e9 pour son audace culinaire et sa cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 sans limites.","longdescr":"Une soir\u00e9e exclusive sur le th\u00e8me du Nouvel An Lunaire, o\u00f9 l'\u00e9quipe de Grabuge r\u00e9invente les codes de la cuisine et m\u00eale les traditions asiatiques \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 culinaire contemporaine.\nNous vous proposons une immersion dans une atmosph\u00e8re chaleureuse et festive, inspir\u00e9e des c\u00e9l\u00e9brations asiatiques traditionnelles.\n \nMENU:\n \n\u2022\u2060  \u2060Raviole \u00e0 la ricotta fum\u00e9e, r\u00e9duction de soja et gingembre\n\u2022\u2060  \u2060Maquereau marin\u00e9, julienne de pomme de terre, goma sauce (s\u00e9same)\n\u2022\u2060  \u2060Daube de b\u0153uf \u00e0 la chinoise, cr\u00e8me de ma\u00efs, ho\u00efsin\n\u2022\u2060  \u2060Chinese sneakers (caramel, chocolat, biscuit)","performers":"Grabuge","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.billetweb.fr\/chefs-table-with-grabuge","email":"hello@fox.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005890"},"sp":{"name":"Chef's table by Grabuge","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.billetweb.fr\/chefs-table-with-grabuge","email":"hello@fox.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005890"},"nl":{"name":"Chef's table by Grabuge","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.billetweb.fr\/chefs-table-with-grabuge","email":"hello@fox.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005890"}},"place":{"id":50002428,"translat