1983, Arkadia has been exploring the richness of Belgium's and Brussels' heritage and developing numerous cultural projects especially in Brussels, between architecture, urbanism, culture, plastic arts and ideology from the Middle Ages to the present day. Seeing and understanding the city and its architectural development, approaching artistic creation and giving it meaning, these are the activities that the ASBL wants to share with the public. Specialists in architectural heritage and contemporary art, they show the city through guided tours and lectures in several languages.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis 1983, Arkadia explore les richesses du patrimoine belge et bruxellois et d\u00e9veloppe de nombreux projets culturels sp\u00e9cialement \u00e0 Bruxelles, entre architecture, urbanisme, culture, arts plastiques et id\u00e9ologie depuis le Moyen \u00c2ge jusqu\u2019\u00e0 nos jours. Voir et comprendre la ville et son d\u00e9veloppement architectural, approcher la cr\u00e9ation artistique et lui donner un sens, telles sont les activit\u00e9s que l'ASBL veut partager avec le public. Sp\u00e9cialistes du patrimoine  architectural et de l'art contemporain, ils font d\u00e9couvrir la ville \u00e0 travers des visites guid\u00e9es et des conf\u00e9rences en plusieurs langues.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Naamsestraat","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/nl","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Naamsestraat, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Sinds 1983 verkent Arkadia de rijkdom van het Belgische en Brusselse erfgoed en ontwikkelt talrijke culturele projecten, vooral in Brussel, tussen architectuur, stedenbouw, cultuur, plastische kunsten en ideologie, van de Middeleeuwen tot vandaag. De stad en haar architecturale ontwikkeling zien en begrijpen, de artistieke creatie benaderen en er een betekenis aan geven, dat zijn de activiteiten die de VZW met het publiek wil delen. Zij zijn gespecialiseerd in architectonisch erfgoed en hedendaagse kunst en laten de stad zien door middel van rondleidingen en lezingen in verschillende talen.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":36946,"location":{"lat":50.84145283,"lon":4.35976257},"last_updated_at":"2023-06-08T12:25:28+02:00","published_at":"2021-07-23T14:48:31+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/50cc706187ef86eefc053d412cc58effa69e53d0.jpg","width":null,"height":null,"ratio":null,"translations":{"de":{"title":"L'h\u00f4tel van Eetvelde et son bureau","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"L'h\u00f4tel van Eetvelde et son bureau","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"L'h\u00f4tel van Eetvelde et son bureau","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"L'h\u00f4tel van Eetvelde et son bureau","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"L'h\u00f4tel van Eetvelde et son bureau","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"L'h\u00f4tel van Eetvelde et son bureau","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"L'h\u00f4tel van Eetvelde et son bureau","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"L'h\u00f4tel van Eetvelde et son bureau","copyright":null}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2025-01-26","doors":null,"start":"11:30:00","end":"13:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2025-02-22","doors":null,"start":"11:30:00","end":"13:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Normal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"}},"value":25}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[]},{"id":5700005915,"date_start":"2025-02-23","date_end":"2025-02-23","date_next":"2025-02-23","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2025-01-28T17:22:02+01:00","published_at":"2025-01-28T17:20:35+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":317055,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"concert","ranking":1.2599210498948732,"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"de":"Konzert","pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"de":["Klassisch"],"pt":[null],"en":["Classical"],"it":["Classica"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Classique"],"sp":["Cl\u00e1sica"],"nl":["Klassiek"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Trio TASIS (intimate tango ensemble) \u2018Porque s\u00ed\u2019: Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, violin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-23-trio-tasis\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005915"},"pt":{"name":"Trio TASIS (intimate tango ensemble) \u2018Porque s\u00ed\u2019: Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, violin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-23-trio-tasis\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005915"},"en":{"name":"Trio TASIS (intimate tango ensemble) \u2018Porque s\u00ed\u2019: Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, violin","shortdescr":"For more than 10 years, Carmela Delgado, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek and Mathias Naon have been sharing and renewing their complicity within numerous projects and large Tango ensembles. Today, the three of them have decided to create a minimalist, intimate group that is as close as possible to the keys and the strings. \n ","longdescr":"Three instruments - bandoneon, piano and violin - and one encounter, rooted in the tango but looking to new horizons. Getting out of Buenos Aires, drawing inspiration from everything that surrounds them here and there: Argentine music as vast as its territory, French chanson, Latin American rhythms, jazz... It's under the pen of arranger\/composer Mathias Naon and in the musical research laboratories they share, that their singularity is born today, at the crossroads of tradition and exploration. \n\nPassing on and sharing their knowledge of tango with all audiences is one of the founding ambitions of the ensemble. Drawing on their extensive teaching experience, they offer a range of services to this end, including discovery concerts for the very young, master classes at conservatoires and music lectures for the general public.\n ","performers":"Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, violin","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-23-trio-tasis\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005915"},"it":{"name":"Trio TASIS (intimate tango ensemble) \u2018Porque s\u00ed\u2019: Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, violin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-23-trio-tasis\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005915"},"cn":{"name":"Trio TASIS (intimate tango ensemble) \u2018Porque s\u00ed\u2019: Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, violin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-23-trio-tasis\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005915"},"fr":{"name":"Trio TASIS (ensemble de tango intimiste) \u00ab Porque s\u00ed \u00bb: Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, violon","shortdescr":"Voil\u00e0 plus de 10 ans que Carmela Delgado, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek et Mathias Naon partagent et renouvellent leur complicit\u00e9 au sein de nombreux projets et grands ensembles de Tango. Aujourd\u2019hui na\u00eet l\u2019envie de cr\u00e9er \u00e0 eux trois une formation, minimaliste, intime, au plus pr\u00e8s des touches et des cordes. \n\n\n ","longdescr":"Trois instruments, bandon\u00e9on, piano, violon, et une rencontre, enracin\u00e9e dans le Tango et tourn\u00e9e vers de nouveaux horizons. Sortir de Buenos Aires, s\u2019inspirer de tout ce qui les entoure ici et l\u00e0-bas : la musique argentine vaste comme son territoire, la chanson fran\u00e7aise, les rythmes d\u2019Am\u00e9rique latine, le jazz\u2026 C\u2019est sous la plume de l\u2019arrangeur compositeur Mathias Naon et dans les laboratoires de recherche musicale qu\u2019ils partagent, que nait aujourd\u2019hui leur singularit\u00e9, au croisement de la tradition et de l\u2019exploration. \n\n\u200bTransmettre et partager avec tous les publics leurs connaissances du tango fait partie des ambitions fondatrices de l\u2019ensemble. Forts de leur exp\u00e9rience p\u00e9dagogique, ils proposent  plusieurs prestations en ce sens : concerts d\u00e9couverte d\u00e8s les plus jeunes \u00e2ges, master classes au sein des conservatoire et conf\u00e9rences musicales tout public.","performers":"Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, violon","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-23-trio-tasis\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005915"},"sp":{"name":"Trio TASIS (intimate tango ensemble) \u2018Porque s\u00ed\u2019: Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, violin","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-23-trio-tasis\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005915"},"nl":{"name":"Trio TASIS (ensemble intieme tango) \u2018Porque s\u00ed\u2019: Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, viool","shortdescr":"Al meer dan 10 jaar delen en vernieuwen Carmela Delgado, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek en Mathias Naon hun compliciteit binnen talrijke projecten en grote tango-ensembles. Vandaag hebben de drie besloten om een minimalistische, intieme groep te cre\u00ebren die zo dicht mogelijk bij de toetsen en snaren staat. \n ","longdescr":"Drie instrumenten - bandoneon, piano en viool - en een ontmoeting, geworteld in de tango maar op zoek naar nieuwe horizonten. Buenos Aires achter zich latend, inspiratie puttend uit alles wat hen hier en daar omringt: Argentijnse muziek zo uitgestrekt als zijn territorium, Franse chanson, Latijns-Amerikaanse ritmes, jazz... Het is onder de pen van arrangeur\/componist Mathias Naon en in de muzikale onderzoekslaboratoria die ze delen, dat hun eigenheid vandaag geboren wordt, op het kruispunt van traditie en verkenning. \n\nHet doorgeven en delen van hun kennis van de tango met alle publieken is een van de stichtende ambities van het ensemble. Puttend uit hun uitgebreide onderwijservaring bieden ze daartoe een reeks diensten aan, waaronder ontdekkingsconcerten voor de allerkleinsten, masterclasses aan conservatoria en muzieklezingen voor het grote publiek.\n ","performers":"Carmela Delgado, bandoneon, Emilie Aridon-Kocio\u0142ek, piano & Mathias Naon, viool","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/2025-02-23-trio-tasis\/","email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005915"}},"place":{"id":242272,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Atelier Marcel Hastir ist ein Ort der Kunst, der kulturellen und k\u00fcnstlerischen Begegnungen, der 1935 von dem Maler Marcel Hastir in seinem K\u00fcnstleratelier in der Rue du Commerce 51 eingerichtet wurde. Das ungew\u00f6hnliche Haus hei\u00dft seit Jahrzehnten inmitten der Kunstwerke sowohl junge K\u00fcnstler als auch gro\u00dfe Namen der belgischen und internationalen Musik- und Theaterszene willkommen - ein Ort, der mit seiner ganz besonderen Atmosph\u00e4re verzaubert.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Handelsstraat","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Handelsstraat, 51","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Atelier Marcel Hastir is a magical place where culture lovers and artists meet in the midst of Marcel Hastir's paintings, in the intimate setting of what has been his place of work since 1935.\r\nMarcel Hastir was a Belgian painter, theosofist and resistance fighter. His studio in the Leopold district served also as a concert hall for young musicians, and during the Second World War this \"painters school\" actually served as a relatively safe meeting place for young artists, students and resistance fighters. A team of passionate volunteers work for the preservation of his work and home organising concerts with both young and confirmed talent from Belgium and abroad.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le nom Marcel Hastir vous dit quelque chose ?  Ce peintre, th\u00e9osophe et r\u00e9sistant belge a v\u00e9cu durant 76 ans (de 1935 jusqu\u2019\u00e0 sa mort) dans la rue du Commerce situ\u00e9e dans le quartier L\u00e9opold \u00e0 Bruxelles. Vous pouvez toujours y admirer ses toiles tout en appr\u00e9ciant de la musique classique ou du th\u00e9\u00e2tre. De grands noms du monde de la musique viennent dans ce lieu sp\u00e9cial depuis des d\u00e9cennies. L'atmosph\u00e8re intime et magique ne vous laissera pas indiff\u00e9rent.    \r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":"https:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/agenda\/","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Rue du Commerce","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Commerce, 51","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Atelier Marcel Hastir","address_street_name":"Handelsstraat","address_street_number":"51","address_street_box":null,"email":"ateliermarcelhastir@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/ateliermarcelhastir.eu\/","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Handelsstraat, 51","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Zegt de naam Marcel Hastir je wat? Hij was een Belgisch kunstschilder, theosoof en verzetsstrijder. Van 1935 tot aan zijn dood 76 jaar later woonde hij in de Handelsstraat in de Brusselse Leopoldwijk. Je kan er zijn doeken nog steeds bewonderen terwijl je geniet van klassieke muziek of theater. Al decennialang komen op deze bijzondere plek grote namen uit de muziekwereld over de vloer. De intieme en magische sfeer zal je niet onberoerd laten.  ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["European Quarter"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"nl":["Europese wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"AtelierMarcelHastir","backoffice_id":4704,"location":{"lat":50.8420134,"lon":4.3685574},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-10-24T10:12:29+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:17:42+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto