gistr\u00e9s par la RTBF !","longdescr":"Et quoi ? Carnaval !\n\nUn esprit festif, une exp\u00e9rience musicale, une connivence collective seront g\u00e9n\u00e9reusement distill\u00e9s avec le Carnaval comme id\u00e9al et indispensable compagnon de soir\u00e9e. Premi\u00e8re destination br\u00e9silienne d\u00e8s 20 heures avec le Brazilian Trio, la deuxi\u00e8me destination permettra de battre le pav\u00e9 \u00e0 votre fa\u00e7on ou de bouger en osmose avec Les Fanfoireux. \u00c9couter, d\u00e9couvrir, se r\u00e9jouir, partager\u2026 Bienvenue !","performers":" Brazilian Trio, Les Fanfoireux","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/le-monde-est-un-village\/2025-02-28\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005605"},"sp":{"name":"Le monde est un village","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/le-monde-est-un-village\/2025-02-28\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005605"},"nl":{"name":"Le monde est un village","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/le-monde-est-un-village\/2025-02-28\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700005605"}},"place":{"id":4,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel Jacques Franck","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Waterloo","address_street_number":"94","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538